              "Eligible graduate degree programs include master's programs (MA, MS, MBA, LLM and others) and juris doctor (JD); non-degree certificate programs are not eligible by themselves",
              "Essay 2 has a maximum length of 1000 words",
              "Three letters of recommendation are required; if proposing a research component, at least one should be from a research advisor at the U.S. institution",
              "A letter of affiliation from an overseas host institution or faculty is optional for Boren Fellowship applicants",
              "Graduate students may supplement overseas study with research, additional academic coursework, and/or internships, and may add private tutoring",
