            "Application Assistance Workshop 1 'Overview of the SCGSR Program and Application process - Preparing an Abstract and Selecting a Priority Area' was held September 3, 2026, 2:00 - 3:30 PM ET.",
            "Application Assistance Workshop 2 'Q&A, Application and Proposal Guidance' is scheduled for October 1, 2026, 2:00 - 4:30 PM ET.",
            "Weekly virtual office hours are held every Friday 1:00 - 2:00 PM ET, starting Friday September 4, 2026.",
