          "source_freshness_rule": "Priority research areas, award periods and key dates are specific to a solicitation cycle; the 2026 Solicitation 2 dates and priority areas are stale once 2027 Solicitation 1 opens. The $3,600 stipend and $3,000 travel caps are current published values but should be re-checked each cycle. Tentative 2027 Solicitation 1 dates must be re-verified against the Key Dates page before being quoted as firm.",
