          "citizenship_residency": "Citizens of participating Commonwealth Small Island Developing States. Applicants must apply from their country of citizenship regardless of where they live, and must not be resident in the UK at the time of application.",
          "international_eligibility": "Explicitly for international applicants: British, dual British, and UK-resident applicants are ineligible, and previous UK government-funded scholarship holders are barred.",
