          "selection_notes": "Applications open 4 August 2026 and close 6 October 2026 at 11:00 UTC. From October 2026 applications are sifted against eligibility criteria. Mid-October 2026 to January 2027: independent reading committees assess all eligible applications. Mid-February 2027: applicants shortlisted for interviews. March to April 2027: interviews take place at British embassies and high commissions. Mid-June 2027: results announced from mid-June onwards. 8 July 2027: unconditional offer deadline, 17:00 BST. September/October 2027: studies begin in the UK.",
          "application_method": [
            "Use the online application system only - 'All Chevening Scholarship applications must be submitted through the online application system.'",
