      "eligibility_summary": "Must meet the general Chevening Fellowship eligibility criteria plus the programme-specific rules: citizenship and residence in one of 35 listed European countries, a postgraduate qualification, at least five years' relevant professional experience, and a security-related role with influence potential.",
      "eligibility": [
        "In addition to meeting our standard eligibility criteria, you must be a citizen of and resident in one of the following countries at the point of application: Andorra, Austria, Belgium, Bulgaria, Croatia, Cyprus, Czechia, Denmark, Estonia, Finland, France, Germany, Gibraltar, Greece, Holy See, Hungary, Iceland, Ireland, Italy, Latvia, Liechtenstein, Lithuania, Luxembourg, Malta, Monaco, the Netherlands, Norway, Poland, Portugal, Romania, San Marino, Slovakia, Slovenia, Spain, Sweden, or Switzerland.",
