          "host_requirements": [
            "Delivered by Cranfield University at the Defence Academy of the United Kingdom, Shrivenham.",
            "The Fellowship is funded by the UK Foreign, Commonwealth and Development Office (FCDO) and delivered by Cranfield University under that funding.",
            "Fellows work on a research project addressing a relevant policy, leadership, organisational, or security challenge, receive academic support, and present findings to the FCDO in London at the end of the fellowship.",
            "Pre-arranged accommodation forms part of the fellowship award; where the host arranges accommodation, an adjusted stipend amount is provided.",
