            "Recorded the published phrase 'pre-arranged accommodation close to Oxford' verbatim rather than silently correcting it to Shrivenham, and flagged the inconsistency for host confirmation.",
            "Did not transfer the Chevening Scholarship application timeline (4 August - 6 October 2026, mid-June results) to this fellowship; Chevening states Fellowship timelines vary, and the fellowship's own 12 October 2026 deadline was used instead.",
            "Did not assert any Chevening Fellowship selection weighting, interview stage or results date, because none is published for this programme.",
            "Did not add a requirement to resign from employment; Chevening states it is not a requirement that Fellows resign, but that it is the applicant's responsibility to ensure release.",
            "Set fully_funded true only because the published package establishes programme fees, living expenses including pre-arranged accommodation, and return economy airfare, plus visa and health-surcharge or insurance support; the uncovered items are listed in not_covered_or_excluded rather than ignored."
          ],
          "source_conflict_rule": "Where the individual programme page conflicts with the Chevening Fellowships terms and conditions or finance pages, the programme page governs the programme-specific deadline, duration and funding package, and the terms and conditions govern award-holder obligations, exclusions and deferral; where two Chevening pages disagree, the more specific and more recently published page is used and the conflict is recorded.",
          "source_freshness_rule": "Chevening Fellowships programme pages carry their own open/close banners; each is re-read at the point of use. Once the 12 October 2026, 11:00 UTC deadline passes the record is treated as closed and must be re-verified against the next cohort's published page.",
