          "selection_notes": "There are no exceptions to the eligibility criteria. A financial assessment forms part of the evaluation process, reviewing documents outlining family gross income, expenses and family assets. Applicants may be invited to complete a video interview and will have one week to record responses on the online application platform, allowing them to reflect on educational and leadership experiences beyond the written application. Applicants do not select which award they will receive; the team automatically considers them for the awards they are eligible for. Applicants who apply are not considered for merit-based awards. Results are released on a rolling basis throughout February to April, and by early to mid-April applicants are told whether they received an award.",
