          "travel_coverage": "None published. No travel, fieldwork or equipment component is described.",
          "fully_funded": false,
          "tuition_rule": "No tuition-waiver rule is published. The award is described as scholarship funding sized between $12,000 and $31,000 per year, which the funder links to enabling full-time study, but no source establishes that tuition, living costs and required expenses are all covered.",
          "home_tuition_rule": null,
