          "not_covered_or_excluded": [
            "No tuition, living-cost, health-insurance, equipment or travel coverage is described by the funder.",
            "Research projects involving the development of a technology that is not an emerging technology but that uses emerging technology as a tool are categorized as the use of emerging technology and are NOT eligible for funding within this program.",
            "At the University of Calgary, students in course-based and professional degree programs are NOT eligible for the Graduate Award Competition.",
            "At the University of Calgary, the AGES top-up is only available to students who have applied for and been awarded both an Alberta Graduate Excellence Scholarships award and an Alberta Innovates Graduate Student Scholarships award.",
