            "Full-time graduate student conducting full-time research at Athabasca University, Concordia University of Edmonton, the University of Alberta, the University of Calgary or the University of Lethbridge",
            "Research in information and communications technologies (ICT) or advanced materials and manufacturing technologies (AMM)",
            "Ability to clearly articulate alignment with Alberta Innovates' Applied Digital & Emerging Technology Areas and potential environmental, health, economic, social and other impacts for Alberta",
