          "citizenship_residency": "Alberta-based enrolment is required. Citizenship is unrestricted: open to Canadian, permanent resident and international graduate students.",
          "international_eligibility": "Explicitly open to international graduate students conducting full-time research in ICT or AMM at one of the five participating Alberta institutions. No Canadian residency or Permanent Resident requirement is published, although the research must be Alberta-based and must produce potential impacts for Alberta.",
          "academic_level_rules": {
