            "From the Student Awards Application landing page, select the award competition you wish to apply for and then the Graduate Award Competition Application.",
            "Review the short list of internal awards the web app has identified for which you are eligible, and tick the check boxes for the awards you want.",
            "Read the terms of reference for each award you select.",
            "Request and track your references so they arrive before or by the application deadline.",
            "Finalize and submit the application, using the visual to-do list to track progress.",
            "Wait for your application to be reviewed by the institution."
