            "Referees submit reference letters through the Student Awards Application reference-tracking feature."
          ],
          "application_portal": "At the University of Calgary, the Student Awards Application is accessed from the Student Centre (https://my.ucalgary.ca) under Apply for Graduate Funding. Alberta Innovates maintains a separate application portal at https://albertainnovates.smartsimple.ca/ which is linked from the site header but is not the route described for this student scholarship, where students apply through their institution.",
          "student_direct_application": true,
