          "timeline_rules": [
            "Alberta Innovates publishes the due date as Continuous and states that the program is accepting applications on a seasonal basis.",
            "The intake open date is specific to each individual university; contact the university of choice for deadline information.",
            "At the University of Calgary, the Graduate Award Competition opens November 1 of each year.",
