          "degree_award": "Funding attached to the student's existing degree programme; no degree is awarded by the programme itself",
          "duration": "At least two semesters, at most the standard period of study (Regelstudienzeit). After each year the university checks whether the scholarship holder still meets the funding criteria. On a successful completion of the degree, funding ends with the announcement of the overall grade, at the latest at the end of the second month after the last examination.",
          "application_cycle": "Annual, university-specific. The federal programme publishes no central window and no central deadline; each participating university sets its own call for applications and deadline, and in some cases runs a selection process for capacity-restricted subjects only after admission.",
          "deadline_central": null,
