            "Funding for foreign institutions participating in the project: they may be partners but receive no funding for that participation.",
            "Acquisition of digital equipment destined to be installed in the premises of the research structures or institutions is not encouraged.",
            "Projects causing significant harm to the environment (DNSH / Do No Significant Harm principle, Article 17 of the EU Taxonomy Regulation) are excluded.",
            "Recurring institutional funding: the aid is explicitly exceptional and separate from it.",
            "No complementary funding for a project under AAPG 2027 or other ANR calls: the AAP does not publish a cumulation rule, so this cannot be stated either way."
          ],
          "benefits": [
            "Monitoring of each funded project by members of the Scientific Council and, where possible, of the FPPC, to be built into project organisation and budgeted",
            "Participation in the Comité des porteurs et porteuses de projets (CPP) of the PEPR GFM",
            "Support from the PEPR GFM operational cell (data component) for e-Infrastructure resources and PGD organisation",
            "Access to a PEPR GFM internal guide for organising and describing data-management elements",
            "Aid contract signed between the ANR and the coordinating institution, with the possibility for the coordinator to pass a share of the aid to partner institutions via a reversement agreement"
