        "applicant_utility": {
          "application_readiness_checklist": [
            "Confirm the coordinating institution is a French higher education or research institution and that you are a permanent staff member able to be named as responsable de projet (only one PEPR GFM project per project leader).",
            "Confirm no member of the PEPR GFM directorate, Scientific Council or FPPC is named as project leader or workpackage leader in your proposal.",
            "Fix the project duration inside 36-54 months and the aid request inside 800 k€-3 M€, and write an explicit justification of that sizing tied to consortium size, permanent-staff involvement and scientific ambition.",
            "Verify the project genuinely reaches beyond 200 m depth and fits at least one of the five Défis; if it does not, do not apply.",
            "Build the wide-interdisciplinary or transdisciplinary argument explicitly, naming which discipline alone could not answer the question and what the non-academic partners contribute to producing knowledge (not only disseminating it).",
            "Budget the mandatory PEPR GFM travel: 2 in-person meetings every 18 months in metropolitan France for project leaders, and 3-4 travels every 2 years for workpackage leaders or staff in training.",
            "Name the data referent, the ethics referent and the equity/inclusion referent in the proposal.",
            "Write the maturation phase (duration, budget, persons, deliverables: operational roadmap, ethical issues analysis, ethics charter, PGD) - it is mandatory and scored.",
            "If you need a new sea campaign on unprogrammed French fleet means, request the upstream operational feasibility study and prepare the ad hoc commission minutes; campaigns already classified as programmable by the CNFH/CNFC can be integrated directly.",
            "Prepare the three-year publication list of every proposing researcher as the scientific document appendix.",
            "Collect signed and stamped commitment letters from every partner early - they are the most common cause of a rejected deposit at validation.",
            "Create the submission-site account immediately; do not wait until November to register."
