      "best_fit": "A permanent researcher at a French research organisation, higher education and research institution, or recognised foundation of scientific cooperation, who can coordinate a 24-48 month precision-psychiatry project of 500 000 € to 2 M€ and, for the clinical and mixed axes, assemble a consortium of at least two different French research structures.",
