      "eligibility_summary": "A French partner may request ANR aid if the consortium has at least three funded partners from three different countries with at least two EU member states or Horizon Europe associated countries, the project matches exactly one ANR-eligible topic, the final TRL for the ANR-funded partner does not exceed 5, no single partner exceeds 60% and no single country exceeds 70% of person-months, and the aid requested stays within the ANR caps.",
      "eligibility": [
        "The pre-proposal or proposal must correspond to one (and only one) scientific collaboration theme defined in the call.",
