          "description": "More than 30 funding agencies participate in the M-ERA.NET 2026 call (2027 edition for the ANR) to finance ambitious transnational R&D projects on research and innovation in materials, supporting the European Green Deal and the United Nations Sustainable Development Goals. The call is structured in 6 themes, of which 4 are eligible for ANR funding. Selected projects' partners are funded directly by their respective national or regional organisations, so national and regional rules apply in addition to the call's own rules. ANR funding is paid for the eligible costs of the French partners only.",
          "purpose": [
            "M-ERA.NET's overall aim is to offer a wide network and a powerful tool to address European and global challenges in research and innovation on advanced materials and battery technologies, supporting the European Green Deal.",
