          "source_freshness_rule": "Status and both step dates are re-checked against the ANR call page and the Appels en cours et à venir listing at every verification. If the step 2 deadline passes or a new edition is published, the record is superseded rather than carried forward, and the step 1 date must not be silently promoted to a deadline.",
