          "unverified_or_removed_claims": [
            "Did not set a single funding_amount: the award is a matrix of city-based monthly amounts plus a capped travel payment, so per the brief the range is carried in text and funding_amount is left null rather than picking one city",
            "Rejected 'Flanders International Fellowship' as a separate programme: a search of vlaanderen.be returns no such programme, and the Flemish international scholarship programme now published is the Fayat scholarships, which fund Flemish students studying at top institutions abroad rather than incoming students",
            "Rejected the Fayat scholarships as out of scope for a host-country record, because the official description is that they support talented students from Flanders to continue their studies at top universities and knowledge institutes",
            "Rejected Luxembourg's Guichet.lu AideFi state financial aid for higher education as a scholarship, and rejected FNR INTER, FNR PRIDE, FNR Fulbright and LuxDev as records: none presents a single open or upcoming individual-applicant scholarship cycle for an incoming international student in the host country",
            "Rejected the claim that the programme is full funding: it is a capped travel payment plus a city-based lump sum, pays no tuition, and excludes Belgium-based placements from travel support",
