          "source_conflict_rule": "The four Flanders Trainee Programme pages (overview, terms and conditions, amounts, application and procedure) are treated as a single official set. Where the overview's budget message and the internships page's vacancy message differ in wording, both are reported as published. The Dutch Order on the subsidisation of internships with multilateral organisations is the legal instrument and would govern if it conflicted with the web summary; that Order was not read in this pass.",
          "source_freshness_rule": "Status for this programme is budget-driven rather than calendar-driven, so it can change at any time within a year. The 2026 exhaustion message and the January 2027 reopening are both dated-stamped observations of the live page on 2026-10-01; any consumer of this record should re-check the programme page before acting, because the annual living-expense amounts are also reset each year.",
