            "coverage": "High — the programme publishes its aims, eligibility, disqualifiers, exact amounts by city, exclusions, budget status, payment schedule, document list, who submits which form, deadlines, post-award duties and contacts. The only structural gap is that the online application form is published in Dutch and its format rules are not specified, and the legal Order underpinning the scheme is linked but not read.",
