      "selection_notes": "Not published on the scheme page. The scheme page states the eligibility conditions and the objective of assisting scholars who have proposed fieldwork abroad in their original approved fellowship or project proposal and made substantial progress, or independent scholars whose research is at an advance stage; the evaluation and sanction procedure is not spelled out on the page and is listed under institution_check_required.",
      "notes": "Not deferrable and not renewable: this is a single research visit capped at two weeks, not a tenure. No must-return-home rule is published because the award funds a short research visit, not a degree. Post-award: expenditure is reimbursed on submission of the statement of expenditure with air ticket costs, visa fees, insurance charges, hotel bills, purchase of foreign currency bill, local airport transfers, photocopy of passport, immigration stamped paper, original boarding pass and a detailed report on the work done. The ICSSR may ask for a copy of the tickets booked and the visa obtained before departure. ICSSR funding must be acknowledged in any publication or monograph brought out from the material collected.",
