          "important_advice_for_students": [
            "Do not treat a university admission offer as a scholarship offer. AfDB states plainly: \"Admission by the JADS partner university does not mean that you have been accepted for scholarship support; accordingly you should not take any action with respect to your current employment or otherwise, until you have been informed by the African Development Bank that you have been awarded the scholarship.\"",
