          "cycle_verified": "January 2027 intake, Mathematical Sciences stream, restricted to South African applicants, with the published application window \"open August to October of the preceding year\", i.e. August to October 2026. Confirmed open on 2026-10-01. The companion September 2027 intake window (\"open January to March\") and the AI for Science stream (September intake only, also January to March) are closed on that date.",
