            "coverage": "High on what matters to an applicant: the live application window, the complete eligibility list, the complete seven-item funding package with a published stipend figure, the five required documents, the four application steps and the interview stage were all read directly from AIMS's own pages. Low on process detail: no closing day, no programme length for the January intake, no selection criteria, no results date and no exclusion list are published, and the application portal itself could not be loaded.",
