      "deadline": "Closing date for applications: 01.12.2026. Online application is possible from September to December 1st; the application deadline for this grant is December 1st, 2026, 23:59 (CET) for all applications for stays during the academic year 2027/28.",
      "deadline_date": "2026-12-01",
