      "english_requirement": "Language skills: very good knowledge of English and/or German. No official testing certificate such as TOEFL is needed, but you should have sufficient knowledge of English in the respective subject area, and your Austrian academic supervisor also has to confirm that your project can be done in English.",
      "application_method": [
        "Secure a written confirmation of supervision from a lecturer at the Austrian target university using the OeAD template",
        "Obtain two letters of recommendation from university lecturers with letterhead, date, signature and the stamp of the university/department; letters must not be older than six months at the time of application",
        "Prepare the passport scan (page with name and photo), the graduation certificate scan, and the additional confirmation for PhD students or postdocs",
