            "Travel costs subsidy of up to EUR 1,200 for holders travelling from or returning to listed non-European developing countries, on submission of original travel invoices"
          ],
          "not_covered_or_excluded": [
            "Accommodation costs – scholarship holders have to pay them themselves",
            "Health insurance premiums – scholarship holders have to pay them themselves (calculate EUR 55 to 200 per month at the moment)",
