          "citizenship_residency": "All countries except Austria; residency in the applicant's home country outside Austria is implied by the requirement not to have lived, studied or pursued academic work in Austria in the last six months and not to be permanently resident in Austria.",
          "international_eligibility": "This is an international incoming grant. All Austrian universities are eligible as host institutions. For non-EU/EEA nationals planning a stay of more than 6 months, the visa process can take several months, and the OeAD advises students from third countries planning a stay of more than 6 months to plan a start from November or December onwards.",
          "academic_level_rules": {
