              "A completed Master's (or diploma) degree counts toward the eligibility route for postgraduates and postdocs who completed their studies after 30 September 2025, evidenced by the graduation certificate"
            ],
            "phd": [
              "PhD students pursuing a doctoral/PhD programme outside Austria must upload a confirmation proving their participation in a PhD programme at their home university",
