          "selection_criteria": [
            "Examination of the formal requirements",
            "Examination of the application's general plausibility",
            "Assessment and evaluation of the application by experts from the respective field",
            "Final decision by the BMFWF",
            "Completeness, coherence and comprehensibility of the information given, adherence to minimum word counts, complete entries and no spelling errors"
          ],
          "selection_notes": "The selection follows a multistage process: 1. Examination of the formal requirements; 2. Examination of the application's general plausibility; 3. Assessment and evaluation of the application by experts; 4. Final decision by the BMFWF. Incomplete applications and applications not complying with the application criteria will not be accepted for the further selection process. The first formal check is carried out by the OeAD, then all formally valid applications are evaluated by experts from the respective field, and based on those results the selection committee awards the best applicants. Results are expected to be published at the beginning of July 2027 and both the applicant and the Austrian academic supervisor are informed by e-mail. The selection is competitive: there is no legal claim to a grant even if all application requirements are fulfilled, and the number of grants awarded depends on the quota and/or available budget.",
          "application_method": [
            "Online application via the OeAD scholarship portal at www.scholarships.at"
          ],
          "application_steps": [
