            "The difference between the EUR 1,300 monthly grant and actual Austrian living costs",
            "Costs incurred before entry to Austria",
            "Additional funds proof the residence authority may demand where accommodation exceeds EUR 386.43 per month",
            "Tuition fees at private universities and private colleges",
            "Any increase of the grant rate for larger expenses, e.g. family accompaniment"
