      "selection_notes": "The RESTART programme's evaluation criteria are: i) scientific quality, innovative character and feasibility of the proposed research plan; ii) merit of the candidate and fit of their profile with the research plan; and iii) impact of the project's execution on the development of the researcher's career.",
      "notes": "Not a tuition, living-cost or personal stipend award: the funding is a project grant to the beneficiary R&D unit. Beneficiary entities are R&D units funded by FCT's Multi-Year Funding Programme, State laboratories, and laboratories associated with a recognised status; where a host institution has no legal personality, the beneficiary entity is the legally constituted institution in which it is integrated. Multiple simultaneous applications are prohibited where work plans overlap in whole or in part, and a funding recommendation in one overlapping application excludes the others from the decision process. Candidates with doubts about the parental-leave day count are invited to contact restart@fct.pt and may request telephone or videoconference support from an FCT team member.",
