          "application_cycle": "Two cycles a year. First application cycle opens 1 November and closes 1 February of the following year (interviews mid-February to March; outcomes from mid-April). Second application cycle opens 1 June and closes 10 August of the following year (interviews mid-August to October; outcomes from mid-November). A*GA may consider off-cycle applications on a case-by-case basis.",
          "deadline_central": "2027-02-01",
