      "eligibility_summary": "Applicants must be Singaporean or nationals intending to take up Singapore citizenship (non-Singaporeans must obtain minimally SPR before studies start and convert during the PhD), hold a good class of Honours degree or equivalent in a relevant discipline, be in the last semester of their final undergraduate year when applying, and have applied or be applying to a PhD programme at a top overseas institution.",
