      "selection_notes": "All applications will be assessed holistically by the School for scholarship eligibility. Successful candidates will be informed on the outcome of their application together with the offer of admissions via email. Anticipate that the outcomes will likely be made available approximately 3 to 6 weeks following the completion of individual interviews. Successful candidates will receive an official NPGS award letter after a final interview conducted at the university level. Applicants who submit GRE/GMAT scores and demonstrate strong quantitative, verbal, and analytical skills through the test will greatly enhance their chances of admission. Physical certificates will not be issued.",
