          "ineligibility_conditions": [
            "UK citizens and residents of the United Kingdom are not eligible ('a citizen of any country outside the United Kingdom')",
            "Gates Cambridge does NOT consider any undergraduate degree, such as BA (undergraduate) or BA affiliated (a second BA)",
            "Gates Cambridge does NOT consider MASt courses",
            "Gates Cambridge does NOT consider part-time degrees other than the PhD",
            "Gates Cambridge does NOT consider professional development courses and non-standard degrees such as: Master of Business (MBA); Executive Master of Business Administration (EMBA) and Global EMBA; Master of Finance (MFin); Executive Master of Accounting; Business Doctorate (BusD); Postgraduate Certificate of Education (PGCE)",
