          "citizenship_residency": "Citizens of any country outside the United Kingdom. There is no restriction on field of study or on nationality beyond being a non-UK citizen.",
          "international_eligibility": "Open to all non-UK citizens, including applicants who are already studying at Cambridge, current Gates Cambridge Scholars applying for a second scholarship, and US citizens resident in the USA (October round only).",
