          ],
          "documents": [
            "Research proposal (PhD applicants only) - most PhD applicants upload it as part of the compulsory admission documents, otherwise it is required for the Gates Cambridge funding application",
            "Transcripts and certificates for each degree taken; an interim or unofficial transcript may be provided if currently studying, with the final transcript required if an offer is made",
