            "Inbound visa costs and the Immigration Health Surcharge are covered",
            "The Gates Cambridge pages read do not publish a required arrival date or a College arrival/orientation rule; the University of Cambridge's 'Prepare to arrive' guidance sits outside the Gates Cambridge pages"
