        "applicant_utility": {
          "application_readiness_checklist": [
            "Confirm you hold a passport from a country outside the United Kingdom; UK citizens and UK residents cannot apply.",
            "Check that your intended Cambridge course is PhD (full-time or part-time), MLitt (full-time) or a one-year full-time postgraduate course, and that it is not on the excluded list (MBA/EMBA/MFin/PGCE/BusD/MASt, MBBChir Clinical Studies, A101 Graduate Course in Medicine, MD Doctor of Medicine, Master of Conservation of Easel Painting).",
            "Open the University of Cambridge Course Directory for your course and record its Course Funding Deadline - this is your real deadline, and it is either 8 December 2026 or 6 January 2027.",
