      "region": "United States (host consortium: Yale University, Stanford University, University of Arizona, UC Berkeley; trainees based at partner research sites in 15 low- and middle-income countries: Bangladesh, Burkina Faso, Colombia, Ecuador, Ethiopia, India, Kenya, Lebanon, Malaysia, Nigeria, Peru, Samoa, Senegal, Tanzania, Uganda)",
      "duration": "12 months, full time (40 hours per week for all 12 months). Fellowship year typically runs July to June; training begins 1 July.",
