        "U.S. applicants must have a professional relationship with a GHES U.S. faculty mentor at one of the partner institutions in order to apply",
        "U.S. applicants must be able to spend 10-12 months at the LMIC site",
        "U.S. Predoctoral Applicants must be currently enrolled in a doctoral (e.g. PhD, DrPH) or health professional (e.g. MD, DO, DDS, DVM) degree program and must have passed qualifying examination(s) at the time of application",
        "U.S. Predoctoral Applicants: U.S. citizens and permanent residents at any U.S. college or university can apply; a professional relationship with a GHES U.S. faculty mentor is required",
