            "U.S. trainees must spend 10-12 months in person at their LMIC research training site, and travel to that site is funded within a reimbursable budget whose amount varies by U.S. home institution.",
            "LMIC trainees must plan a 1-3 month training period at their primary U.S. mentor's university."
