          "documents": [
            "Research proposal - 2 pages, covering Specific Aims; Research Plan (overview) with Significance, Innovation and Approach; Timeline for proposed scope of work; Human Subjects describing the IRB process and timeline for approval. References should be provided but will not count toward the two-page limit.",
            "Budget and budget justification - 1 page; can include personnel and travel costs. Up to USD 10,000 for research expenses for U.S. or foreign postdoctoral applicants; up to USD 7,000 for U.S. doctoral applicants.",
