      "best_fit": "Conservationists in the early stages of their careers - current MSc or PhD students, or people who graduated from such studies in the past three years - running a small or pilot nature conservation project on threatened species, habitats, human-wildlife conflict or community education in an eligible country, who can show a clear conservation benefit.",
