          "selection_notes": "AfDB route: the Bank's Human Resources Department carries out an initial vetting of applications to develop a short list of ten (10) applicant files to be further reviewed by the Foundation; a short list of three (3) candidates is presented to the President of the Bank or his designate for final selection. Only applicants who fully meet the Bank's requirements and are considered for interview will be contacted, and the President reserves the right to appoint a candidate at a lower level. UNECA route: due to an anticipated high volume of applications only finalists are contacted and no feedback is given to unsuccessful applicants; received applications are acknowledged within one week; an update is posted to the ECA fellowship page once selection concludes. The Mo Ibrahim Foundation page does not publish a selection method of its own beyond routing applicants to the hosts.",
          "application_steps": [
            "Choose the host organisation route from the links published on the Mo Ibrahim Foundation fellowships page: African Development Bank (Abidjan), International Trade Centre (Geneva) or UNECA (Addis Ababa).",
            "AfDB route: go to the vacancy page for the 2027 Mo Ibrahim Foundation Leadership Fellowship Program and complete the online application form on the Bank's recruitment system (external candidates apply at https://afdb.jobs2web.com/job-invite/2343/).",
            "AfDB route: prepare a comprehensive CV that states date of birth, nationality, education and relevant experience, and attach copies of academic transcripts and three letters of recommendation.",
            "UNECA route: create an account on the UN Inspira system (https://inspira.un.org), then build a draft Administrative Profile with no linked Job Opening and generate it as a PDF; the cover/motivation letter is created as part of that process and appears on page 1.",
            "UNECA route: complete the required online survey and take a screenshot showing the responses were sent, in PDF format.",
            "UNECA route: obtain three letters of recommendation addressed to the '2027 ECA Mo Ibrahim Leadership Fellow Selection Committee'; referees send them to the applicant, not to ECA.",
            "UNECA route: email all documents in one message as PDF attachments to RecruitmentPPost@un.org with the subject line 'ECA 2027 Mo Ibrahim Leadership Fellowship (Applicant Last Name, First Name)'; the AP PDF, degree certificate copies, the three recommendation letters and the survey screenshot must all be in that single email.",
            "ITC route: apply through the ITC vacancy published on the UN Careers system.",
            "Submit before the closing date on the host's own timeline; AfDB closes 20 November 2026 and UNECA closes 20 November 2026 at 11:59 p.m. Addis Ababa time.",
            "Save the submission confirmation. Received applications will be acknowledged within one week on the UNECA route."
          ],
          "applicant_submission_route": [
            "The applicant submits the application directly. There is no nomination by a university, ministry or employer on any of the three routes.",
            "AfDB route: online application form on the Bank's website, submitted through the Bank's own recruitment portal (https://afdb.jobs2web.com/job-invite/2343/ for external candidates).",
            "UNECA route: email submission to RecruitmentPPost@un.org. The notice is explicit that the applicant, not the referee and not the institution, sends the complete package.",
            "ITC route: application through the ITC vacancy published on the UN Careers system (https://careers.un.org/jobSearchDescription/285022?language=en)."
          ],
          "application_portal": "AfDB route: https://www.afdb.org/en/vacancy/2027-mo-ibrahim-foundation-leadership-fellowship-program-96407, with external candidates applying at https://afdb.jobs2web.com/job-invite/2343/. UNECA route: no portal — applications are emailed to RecruitmentPPost@un.org, with the Administrative Profile PDF generated from https://inspira.un.org. ITC route: https://careers.un.org/jobSearchDescription/285022?language=en.",
          "student_direct_application": true,
          "deferrable": null,
          "renewable": false,
          "return_home_required": null,
          "clinical_restriction": null,
          "arrival_rules": [
            "The travel and shipping costs for the assumption of duty are borne and paid out of funds provided by the Foundation (AfDB and UNECA notices).",
            "AfDB duty station: headquarters of the Bank in Abidjan, Republic of Côte d'Ivoire, or any other location from which the Bank carries out its operations.",
            "UNECA duty station: Addis Ababa, Ethiopia.",
            "ITC duty station: Geneva.",
            "The Fellow signs a contract with the host before commencing of service, and on the UNECA route receives a Letter of Award from ECA before commencement of service.",
            "No arrival date, latest-arrival rule or visa support arrangement is published on any official page read."
          ],
          "timeline_rules": [
            "UNECA application period: 21 September 2026 to 20 November 2026 (2027 Mo Ibrahim Fellowship Programme notice).",
            "UNECA deadline: 20 November 2026, 11:59 p.m. (23:59) Addis Ababa time (GMT+3). Any applications received after this deadline will not be reviewed and no exceptions will be made.",
