            "UNECA: received applications will be acknowledged within one week of receipt.",
            "UNECA: an update on the 2027 selection outcome will be posted at https://www.uneca.org/about/fellowship once the selection process has concluded.",
            "The Foundation page states the 2027 application process is open and directs applicants to each host's website for details and to apply; no Foundation-level closing date is published on the page itself.",
