          "official_application_route": [
            "AfDB route: complete the online form on the Bank's website at https://www.afdb.org/en/vacancy/2027-mo-ibrahim-foundation-leadership-fellowship-program-96407. Regular Bank staff apply through the Bank's internal system; external candidates apply through https://afdb.jobs2web.com/job-invite/2343/.",
            "UNECA route: email the complete application to RecruitmentPPost@un.org with subject line 'ECA 2027 Mo Ibrahim Leadership Fellowship (Applicant Last Name, First Name)', attaching the AP PDF, degree certificate copies, three letters of recommendation and the survey screenshot as PDFs in one message.",
            "ITC route: apply through the ITC vacancy published on the UN Careers system at https://careers.un.org/jobSearchDescription/285022?language=en.",
