          "source_conflict_rule": "The Mo Ibrahim Foundation page governs the programme identity and the published stipend. Each host organisation's own notice governs its application system, deadline, document list, language rules and any host-set additional criteria. Where the Foundation date and a host date differ, the host date is recorded as binding in deadline_institutional and the applicant is directed to the host page.",
          "source_freshness_rule": "The cycle is annual and each host republishes its own notice every year, so anything older than the September 2026 openings is treated as stale and re-verified before use. Host notices are host-specific: a previous year's host terms are not carried forward.",
