          "institution_check_required": [
            "tax_status left null: no official page states how the allowances are taxed, either by the MRF or by the South African Revenue Service",
            "return_home_required left null: no official page states an obligation to return to the applicant's home country after the Scholarship, although economy-class flights at the end of the degree are covered",
            "clinical_restriction left null: no official page states a clinical or field-of-practice restriction. Note only that South African Masters programmes may require several years of clinical experience as an admission requirement, which is an entry condition set by the university rather than a restriction published by the Foundation",
