          "source_conflict_rule": "The Explore & apply page governs the published funding scope, the not-covered list, the application process and the timeline. The Terms and Conditions PDF governs tenure conditions, financial mechanics, rebates, institutional changes, donor interaction, failure to meet degree requirements, personal-update obligations and liability. Where the two differ, the Terms and Conditions are treated as binding, because they are the Foundation's contractual document.",
          "source_freshness_rule": "The cohort and its dates change every year, so a stale page carries last cycle's opening date and must be re-verified before use. The list of participating institutions and the award conditions are also reviewed between cycles; the Terms and Conditions are the version that is applied to a Scholar when the award is taken up.",
