        "verification": {
          "cycle_verified": "Recurring annual cycle: application window 1 January to midnight 1 March, participation confirmation 22 March, cohort announced for the same year. As at 2026-10-01 the next published window is 1 January 2027 to midnight 1 March 2027, so the record is correctly marked upcoming.",
          "verification_confidence": 0.94,
          "official_fields_confirmed": [
            "Annual application window of 1 January to midnight 1 March on TEFConnect (TEF Entrepreneurship Programme page)",
