            "All five eligibility criteria: African and 18 or above; a business idea or a business no older than 5 years; residing in Africa and planning to establish the business in Africa; never having benefitted from any previous Foundation programme; not having applied in the same window of the same year",
            "Government-issued ID displaying date of birth and photo plus high-resolution headshot, and the exact-match requirement between TEFConnect details and the ID",
            "Four-section application form and the four required applicant actions (complete mandatory fields, attach documents, submit, receive eligibility notification)",
