          "host_requirements": [
            "The programme is implemented through partner universities and non-governmental organizations. The applicant must apply through one of the affiliated institutions and is expected to study there.",
            "The Foundation publishes a searchable list of Mastercard Foundation Scholars Program institutions at https://mastercardfdn.org/en/what-we-do/our-programs/mastercard-foundation-scholars-program/where-to-apply/. The list did not render on the page when read on 2026-10-01, so specific partner institutions could not be enumerated from the Foundation's own listing.",
            "Partner institutions offer different programmes and have their own timelines for admission, fees and application guidelines; the Foundation directs applicants to research the programme of their choice and contact the institution directly.",
