            "Accommodation is within the published financial support, and the Handbook describes accommodation as part of the wraparound support.",
            "The Foundation publishes no arrival date, latest-arrival rule, visa support arrangement or relocation timetable. Each partner institution's own admission timeline governs when a Scholar must arrive.",
