            "The Foundation has committed over 58,000 scholarships and states a goal of 100,000 scholarships committed by 2030.",
            "There are over 62 global partners, primarily in Africa, with partners also in North and Central America, Europe and the Middle East.",
            "Each partner institution offers different programmes and has its own timelines for admission, fees and application guidelines.",
