          "source_conflict_rule": "The Inlaks Foundation fellowship page and the 2027 Submittable application instructions are the two official sources and are consistent on eligibility, stipend, duration and deadline. Where the landing page is silent on a procedural detail, the application instructions govern; where the landing page carries a headline statement the instructions expand, both are recorded. The Foundation retains discretion over the final stipend amount, so where the stated tier and the actual amount differ, the discretionary note prevails.",
