      "description": "RISE Germany funds three-month summer research internships at German universities and research institutions for undergraduates from North America, the UK and Ireland studying biology, chemistry, physics, earth sciences, engineering or computer science. Students are matched with a doctoral-student mentor (or a researcher at a university of applied sciences). The published award is a monthly stipend of 992 Euro, health, accident and private liability insurance, a lump sum towards international travel costs and a 160 Euro lump sum for travel within Germany.",
