      "selection_notes": "Ranks applicants with providers (host institutions) between January 14 and January 25, 2027; internship positions are announced around February/March 2027. About 300 scholarships are available each year.",
      "notes": "German language is not required for most positions and the working language is English. Research internships take place during the summer break in Germany; host institutions are matched by field of interest (biology, chemistry, physics, earth sciences, engineering, or a closely related field).",
