            "Mitacs scholarship for 100 Canadian applicants: 7,000 CAD provided directly by Mitacs for travel costs and living expenses, with health, accident and liability insurance provided by DAAD",
            "Housing assistance from host universities, universities of applied sciences and institutes, and matching with Ph.D. student mentors or researchers (UAS only)",
