          "award_holder_conditions": [
            "Submit an original doctoral degree certificate or diploma before the fellowship start date",
            "Airfare and settling-in allowance are not paid to candidates already resident in Japan with a mailing address",
            "Each host researcher may submit a maximum of three applications",
            "Sign and submit Form A, Notice of Acceptance and Pledge, as early as possible",
            "Submit Form 1, Notice of the Schedule for Fellowship Commencement, one month prior to the Fellow's arrival",
