            "Submit Form 6, Notice of Fellowship Commencement, within 1 week after the starting date of the fellowship",
            "Submit Form 7, Notice of Temporary Leave of Absence from Japan, two weeks before departure",
            "Submit Form 8, Application for the Change of Host Researcher/Host Institution, and Form 9, Notice of the Change of Host's/Fellow's Information, as early as possible when determined",
            "Submit Form 10, Application for Fellowship Suspension (Change in Period), one month prior to suspension, and Form 11, Notice of Fellowship Recommencement, one month prior to restarting",
