            "As a rule JSPS does not issue documents certifying fellowship status; use copies of the Award Letter or Certificate of Financial Support, or ask the Institution to prepare the necessary documents. The only exception is a certificate for a job application after the fellowship, requested using Form 17 at least two weeks before the certificate is needed",
