          "selection_notes": "Published FY2026 outcomes by review section. 1st recruitment: Humanities 19 applied / 2 selected; Social sciences 23 / 3; Mathematical and physical sciences 39 / 5; Chemistry 10 / 1; Engineering sciences 27 / 3; Informatics 12 / 2; Biological sciences 15 / 2; Agriculture/Environmental sciences 11 / 1; Medicine dentistry and pharmacy 9 / 1; total 165 applied / 20 selected, selection ratio 12.1%. 2nd recruitment: Humanities 17 / 3; Social sciences 12 / 2; Mathematical and physical sciences 36 / 5; Chemistry 3 / 1; Engineering sciences 25 / 4; Informatics 9 / 1; Biological sciences 8 / 1; Agriculture/Environmental sciences 16 / 2; Medicine dentistry and pharmacy 10 / 1; total 136 applied / 20 selected, selection ratio 14.7%. 3rd recruitment: Humanities 24 / 3; Social sciences 18 / 2; Mathematical and physical sciences 37 / 4; Chemistry 8 / 1; Engineering sciences 32 / 4; Informatics 14 / 2; Biological sciences 17 / 2; Agriculture/Environmental sciences 12 / 1; Medicine dentistry and pharmacy 12 / 1; total 174 applied / 20 selected, selection ratio 11.5%.",
