      "selection_notes": "Selection proceeds from graduate school admission, to recommendation submission by the graduate school, to a foundation interview, to final selection announcement, to the certificate award ceremony. Intermediary ranking criteria are not published on the page.",
      "notes": "The applicant cannot apply directly to the foundation: the recommendation must come from the admitting graduate school, and admission to a designated university is the gateway step. Both the eligible-country list and the eligible-university list are marked tentative on the official page, so confirm the current year's list before applying. Insurance is covered as the National Health Insurance premium. Travel costs are not listed among the benefits, so airfare is not assumed to be covered.",
      "image_url": "https://www.postf.org/uploads/media/svg_eng.svg",
      "image_source_url": "https://www.postf.org/en/asia/abroad/business",
