          "tuition_rule": "Tuition is one of the six published benefits, on a semester-capped basis: full tuition for 4 semesters for the Master's program, and full tuition for 6 semesters for the Doctoral or Integrated Master's and Doctoral program. The published terms therefore cover a stated number of semesters rather than the whole enrolment, and any semester beyond that cap is outside the published benefit.",
          "home_tuition_rule": null,
          "host_institution_fee": null,
          "tax_status": null,
          "covered_expenses": [
