            "Living expenses of KRW 1,000,000 per month for 22 months (Master's) or 36 months (Doctoral/integrated)",
            "Initial settlement fee of KRW 1,000,000, one-time",
            "National Health Insurance premium (NHIS)",
            "Support for Korean language education, certificate award ceremonies, welfare services and Korean cultural experience programs"
          ],
          "not_covered_or_excluded": [
            "Tuition is published as full tuition for a fixed number of semesters only, 4 for the Master's program and 6 for the Doctoral or Integrated Master's and Doctoral program, so any further enrolled semester is outside the published benefit",
            "Living expenses are published for a fixed period only, 22 months for the Master's program and 36 months for the Doctoral or Integrated program, so living costs after that period are outside the published benefit",
            "Travel is not among the six published benefits, which are tuition, living expenses, settlement fee, insurance premium, Korean excellence scholarship and experience Korean culture, so airfare and relocation costs are not established as covered",
