            "Eligible countries (tentative): China, India, Indonesia, Japan, Kazakhstan, Malaysia, Myanmar, Philippines, Saudi Arabia, Singapore, Thailand, United Arab Emirates, Vietnam, Argentina, Brazil, Mexico, United States, Germany, Italy, Poland, Slovakia, Türkiye, United Kingdom, Egypt, Morocco, South Africa",
