          "selection_notes": "Selection proceeds from graduate school admission, to recommendation submission by the graduate school, to a foundation interview, to final selection announcement, to the certificate award ceremony. The Foundation publishes the stage sequence and the quota of 20 students per year subject to change, but publishes no ranking or scoring criteria, and publishes all stage dates only as approximate months.",
