            "Living expenses beyond the published monthly amount of KRW 1,000,000 and beyond the 22 or 36 month period",
            "Tuition for any semester beyond the published 4 (Master's) or 6 (doctoral or integrated) semester cap",
            "Costs of dependants accompanying the awardee, which the published benefit list does not mention",
            "Any university fees not classified as tuition, such as some student service charges",
            "Visa, residence-card and relocation costs, none of which appear in the published benefit list"
