      "english_requirement": "Applicants whose native language is not English must submit an official transcript confirming completion of studies at an English-speaking university or college within the past five years; or TOEFL 570+ (paper), 230+ (computer), or 79+ (internet-based/IBT); or IELTS 6.5 or equivalent.",
