      "application_period": "Two calls in the 2026 academic course. 1a convocatoria (Primavera 2026) deadlines ran 16 March to 10 April 2026 and are closed. 2a convocatoria (Otono 2026) is open with deadlines of 19, 26 and 30 October 2026 depending on the institution and programme; selected candidates are announced in November 2026 and programmes start in October/November 2026 depending on the programme.",
      "status": "open",
