          "program_type": "Intergovernmental scholarship (SG/OAS) with private higher education institutions",
          "region": "Latin America and the Caribbean (OAS Member States); study delivered by institutions in Spain, Peru and Mexico",
          "coverage": "Covers a percentage of tuition only: 60% of total tuition for official master's programmes and official degrees, and 50% of total tuition for UNIR Formacion Permanente, applicable only to the value of the study programme. Excludes admission fee, translation, notarisation or authentication, study materials, titulation and degree procedures, and any other cost not listed. Living costs, travel and insurance are not addressed.",
          "official_source_urls": [
