          "application_cycle": "2026-2027 admission cycle for Fall 2027 entry. Application portal opens 7 September 2026, 8a.m. GST for all graduate programs except M.Sc. and Ph.D. Computational Biology, which opens 30 September 2026, 8a.m. GST. Final application deadline 15 December 2026, 5p.m. GST for all graduate programs except the Master in Applied Artificial Intelligence, which has a deadline of 28 February 2027, 5p.m. GST. Decision notification date 31 March 2027; offer response deadline 15 April 2027 (30 April 2027 for MAAI).",
