          "international_eligibility": "Explicitly open to international students, who are named as a separate category in the published funding table. Document requirements differ by residency status: all applicants need a valid passport copy and a photo with white background; UAE nationals additionally need a valid Emirates ID, a passport copy with unified ID number, and for males a national service completion/exemption letter; UAE residents additionally need a valid UAE visa and a valid Emirates ID.",
