      ],
      "selection_notes": "The admission procedure includes a number of tests, interviews and additional conditions. The interview is a mandatory part of the admission process and applicants must successfully pass it to complete the scholarship requirements. The review and final approval process typically takes between 3 to 5 months, with applicants notified of updates by email or SMS.",
      "notes": "This is a service-obligation scholarship, not free money to study anywhere: applicants must agree to join the UAE diplomatic corps at MOFA for a period equivalent to the number of academic years covered by the scholarship, and must agree to join the Anwar Gargash Diplomatic Academy upon graduation. Only UAE nationals may apply, and only MOFA-approved universities are eligible, so an applicant who already has an offer from an unlisted institution cannot use this programme. Male applicants must have completed or been exempt from national service. Applicants who defer or want to change their major or country of study must inform the relevant programme officer at the Ministry and notify the cultural attaché in the country of study. The published page states that MOFA covers all tuition costs but does not publish any statement on living costs, accommodation, airfare or a stipend.",
      "image_url": "https://www.mofa.gov.ae/MOFAAssets/images/logo.png",
