      "detail": {
        "official_details": {
          "description": "The Ministry of Foreign Affairs (MoFA) provides a scholarship program for outstanding Emirati students who wish to pursue their academic journey abroad at one of the world's top prestigious international universities, with the aim of specializing in fields that meet the needs of the UAE diplomatic corps, and enriching it with qualified Emirati personnel and a generation trained to the highest standards. It is not a conventional academic scholarship: it funds a Bachelor's degree abroad at an MOFA-approved university, then a post-graduate diploma at the Anwar Gargash Diplomatic Academy, then appointment to the diplomatic corps. The FAQ states that the Ministry of Foreign Affairs covers all tuition costs in accordance with the program's policies, and no living-cost, accommodation, airfare or stipend provision is published anywhere on the programme page.",
          "purpose": [
