            "Published programme objectives: preparing national competencies for the future of UAE diplomacy; developing diplomatic leaders capable of positively influencing the international arena; providing essential skills to become pioneers and change-makers in UAE foreign policy; instilling an innovation culture that promotes positive change and development in diplomacy; and enabling achievements by providing tools for excellence in the diplomatic corps.",
            "To be part of the UAE Government vision to prepare a generation of leaders in the field of diplomacy."
          ],
          "sdg_requirement": false,
