      "selection_notes": "Applications are assessed at published evaluation cut-off dates against the eligibility criteria and the fellowship selection process. The EMBO Fellowship Committee is responsible for the scheme; detailed selection criteria are in the Postdoctoral Fellowships guidelines.",
      "notes": "This is a postdoc award: it pays a salary or stipend, not tuition. EMBO explicitly states it does not cover bench fees, overheads, or consumables, and that the non-EMBC stipend is solely intended to cover the cost of living in the host country and might be subject to taxation. Host-lab restriction of one candidate per round applies from the Autumn 2026 round. Re-application is allowed only once, and from the Autumn 2027 round (applications after 22 January 2027) it is not permitted at all. Fellowships must start within one calendar year of the relevant cut-off.",
      "image_url": "https://www.embo.org/wp-content/uploads/2020/08/Logo.svg",
