          "application_cycle": "Continuous, with two evaluation cycles a year. Applications are accepted throughout the year and enter one of two evaluation cycles depending on the time of submission: a spring evaluation covering all eligible applications submitted by the fourth Friday of January at 14:00 CET, with results around mid-June, and an autumn evaluation covering all eligible applications submitted by the second Friday of July at 14:00 CEST, with results around mid-December.",
          "deadline_central": "2027-01-22",
          "deadline_central_display": "Applications accepted throughout the year. Next cutoff date - hard deadline: Friday 22 January 2027, 14:00 CET (this is the fourth Friday of January, the spring evaluation cut-off). The autumn evaluation cut-off is the second Friday of July at 14:00 CEST.",
          "deadline_institutional": null,
          "deadline_note": "The reference date for eligibility and evaluation is the date, in Central European (Summer) Time, on which the candidate confirms that their application is complete. Registration for an online application account is not sufficient to enter an evaluation round: an application is only regarded as complete once all required information is submitted and the candidate confirms completion. Applications completed after 14:00 CET on the day of the deadline enter the next evaluation round, and no exceptions can be made.",
