          "tax_status": "The stipend outside EMBC Member States might be subject to taxation, and the stipend rate depends on the country visited. EMBO cannot advise on national tax regulations and recommends fellows contact the relevant authorities in the host country. For the contract route, the grant covers taxes as required by national and local laws and regulations.",
