          "arrival_rules": [
            "Fellowships must be started within one calendar year from the relevant evaluation cut-off.",
            "A candidate who has already started working in the host laboratory may apply only if they have been living in the host country for less than six months at the time the application is submitted.",
            "The travel and relocation allowance is paid as a lump sum, ideally before the start date of the fellowship."
