          "timeline_rules": [
            "Applications are accepted throughout the year and enter one of two evaluation cycles depending on the time of submission.",
            "Spring evaluation: all eligible applications submitted by the fourth Friday of January, 14:00 CET. Next hard deadline: Friday 22 January 2027, 14:00 CET. Results announced around the mid of June.",
            "Autumn evaluation: all eligible applications submitted by the second Friday of July, 14:00 CEST. Results announced around the mid of December.",
            "The date on which the candidate confirms the application is complete, in Central European (Summer) Time, is the reference date for eligibility and evaluation.",
            "Applications completed after 14:00 CET on the day of the deadline enter the next evaluation round; no exceptions can be made.",
            "Fellowship duration: up to two years, minimum one year; start within one calendar year of the cut-off; maximum total duration including part-time is 36 months.",
            "Laboratory Leadership Course waivers are available within three years of being awarded the fellowship, and only if the fellowship is held for at least six months.",
            "Effective from the Autumn 2027 selection round, that is for all applications submitted after 22 January 2027 at 14:00 CET, re-applications will no longer be permitted."
