            "Tuition fees, which are not mentioned anywhere on the scheme pages",
            "Any insurance, equipment, computing or conference costs beyond the employment contract or stipend",
            "Funding beyond the fellowship period: no renewal beyond the published two years, or 36 months maximum including part-time",
            "Childcare costs above the 2,500 euro per year per child allowance for non-EMBC fellows, and any shortfall where the allowance is prorated",
