            "Rejected tuition_coverage and tuition_rule: no page read mentions tuition, so both are null rather than inferred from the employment-contract model.",
            "Rejected travel_coverage as a figure: EMBO publishes a travel and relocation lump sum but no amount on the pages read, so travel_coverage records the existence of the lump sum only.",
            "Set return_home_required to false on the explicit published basis that applications to the country of the PhD are not considered, so a return home is structurally impossible under the scheme.",
            "Set renewable to true on the basis of the published parental-leave extension mechanism and the 36-month maximum, which are the only extensions EMBO publishes; the page does not describe a separate renewal application.",
            "Set deferrable to null: EMBO publishes no deferral provision, only a one-year start window and extension for parental leave.",
            "Left official_contacts.email null because the published address is obfuscated on the page and must not be guessed.",
            "Did not import the Scientific Exchange Grants, New Venture Fellowships, Core Facility Fellowships, Young Investigator Programme, Installation Grants, Global Investigator Network or Science Journalism Fellowships terms, which are separate EMBO programmes listed alongside this one."
          ],
          "source_conflict_rule": "The dedicated Postdoctoral Fellowship pages (overview, Eligibility, Benefits, Application) govern this award. The umbrella fellowships page is used only for context. Where the pages refer out to the guidelines, the Contract rates sheet and the Travel and relocation policy, those documents govern and the gap is recorded rather than filled. The benefit pages state that changes affecting applicants entering the first evaluation round in 2020 and onwards apply, with earlier applicants and current fellows remaining under the stipend-based EMBO Long-Term Fellowships scheme, so the current pages govern anyone applying now.",
          "source_freshness_rule": "The scheme pages are undated but the guidelines are versioned (June 2026) and are re-read on every verification. The two evaluation cut-offs are recomputed each year, since they are defined relative to Fridays rather than fixed dates, and the spring cut-off of 22 January 2027 is verified to be the fourth Friday of January 2027. The abolition of reapplication from the Autumn 2027 round is re-checked each cycle, as it is a dated policy change rather than a standing rule.",
          "source_citations": [
            "https://www.embo.org/funding/fellowships/",
            "https://www.embo.org/funding/fellowships-grants-and-career-support/postdoctoral-fellowships/",
            "https://www.embo.org/funding/fellowships-grants-and-career-support/postdoctoral-fellowships/eligibility/",
            "https://www.embo.org/funding/fellowships-grants-and-career-support/postdoctoral-fellowships/benefits/",
            "https://www.embo.org/funding/fellowships-grants-and-career-support/postdoctoral-fellowships/application/",
            "https://www.embo.org/funding/fellowships-grants-and-career-support/postdoctoral-fellowships/faqs/ - linked but not fetched"
          ],
          "researched_by": "f2",
          "last_verified_date": "2026-10-01",
          "data_quality": {
            "source_level": "Official provider pages (EMBO, embo.org)",
            "coverage": "High for eligibility, mobility rules, funding routes, benefits, allowances, leave and part-time provisions, application process, deadlines and contacts, all of which are published across the four scheme pages read; Low for actual monetary rates, which are published only in downloadable sheets that are PDFs.",
            "pages_read": [
              "https://www.embo.org/funding/fellowships/",
              "https://www.embo.org/funding/fellowships-grants-and-career-support/postdoctoral-fellowships/",
              "https://www.embo.org/funding/fellowships-grants-and-career-support/postdoctoral-fellowships/eligibility/",
              "https://www.embo.org/funding/fellowships-grants-and-career-support/postdoctoral-fellowships/benefits/",
              "https://www.embo.org/funding/fellowships-grants-and-career-support/postdoctoral-fellowships/application/"
            ],
            "pages_unreadable": [
              "https://www.embo.org/fellowships/ - the URL recorded in the worklist. HTTP 404 from webfetch, and direct fetches of it and of https://embo.org/fellowships/ failed with the connection closing unexpectedly. The live equivalent is https://www.embo.org/funding/fellowships/, which was read.",
              "http://www.embo.org/documents/PDF/Postdoctoral_Fellowships_guidelines.pdf - the governing guidelines document (dated June 2026). PDF, so its text cannot be extracted and its detailed criteria remain unverified.",
              "Contract rates and Travel and relocation policy - published downloads from the scheme pages; the rates they contain are therefore unverified.",
              "The EMBO Selection, Research Integrity and FAQs pages - linked from the scheme pages but not fetched, so the assessment method and the FAQ guidance are unverified."
            ]
          }
        }
