            "Count your post-doctoral months: you must have fewer than 24, and you must hold a PhD or complete one by the time the funding starts.",
            "Confirm your research sits inside the Royal Society's natural-sciences remit and that you will conduct it in a UK institution.",
            "Read the scheme notes before applying, because the page explicitly says to ensure you meet all eligibility requirements.",
            "Build your budget knowing that salary and on-costs and directly allocated costs are only funded at 80%, research expenses at 100%, and that relocation and visa costs sit outside the Â£703,800 cap if you claim them.",
            "Request any adjustment from adjustments@royalsociety.org or +44 20 7451 2666 well before 18 November 2026 - deadline extension, extra help with the form, or a Word-format form are all available but must be arranged.",
            "Apply through Flexi-GrantÂ® as soon as it opens, because the 2027 round opened on 22 September 2026 and closes on 18 November 2026.",
            "Prepare for an in-person interview at the Royal Society focused on the importance and scientific validity of your work."
