      "region": "Germany (host research institution)",
      "duration": "Postdocs: 6 to 24 months, divided into up to three stays within three years. Experienced researchers: 6 to 18 months, divided into up to three stays within three years.",
      "deadline": "Rolling in three calls per year, each opening approximately eight months before the selection meeting and closing when 800 applications are received. The next call opens on 15 November 2026 for the July 2027 selection meeting, with the earliest possible fellowship start in September 2027. The current call has reached the maximum of 800 applications and no new applications can be created.",
      "deadline_date": "2026-11-15",
