        "A two to four month intensive German language course immediately prior to the research fellowship (not part of the research fellowship period)",
        "Host institute receives an allowance for research costs of €800 per month for natural sciences and engineering, or €500 for humanities and social sciences"
      ],
      "benefits": [
        "Personal support from the Humboldt Foundation and its sponsorship portfolio throughout the award",
        "Flexible start date determined by the fellow",
        "Alumni sponsorship measures after the research stay, including possible return fellowships",
