          "arrival_rules": [
            "You are flexible in determining when you would like to start your fellowship.",
            "The fellowship must be started within the published window: the earliest possible start after each selection meeting is February, May or September of the year following the meeting, depending on the call.",
            "An intensive language course for you and your partner is available prior to the research fellowship."
          ],
          "timeline_rules": [
            "Three calls a year, each opening approximately eight months before the selection meeting, and each closing when it reaches the maximum of 800 applications.",
            "Calls schedule: opens 15 March for a selection meeting in November and an earliest start in February of the following year; opens 15 July for a selection meeting in March and an earliest start in May; opens 15 November for a selection meeting in July and an earliest start in September.",
            "2026 calls: 15 March 2026 / November 2026 / February 2027; 15 July 2026 / March 2027 / May 2027; 15 November 2026 / July 2027 / September 2027.",
            "The next call opens on 15 November 2026; the current call has reached its application cap and no new applications can be created at present.",
            "The deadline for meeting formal conditions, in particular career-stage limits and previous stays in Germany, is the date the application is received.",
            "If you cannot submit before the portal closes, your application is treated as received on the date the portal closed, provided you submit no more than 14 days after the next call opens.",
