            "Applying outside the four-year postdoc or twelve-year experienced-researcher window without qualifying under the 16-year postgraduate-degree exception.",
            "Already having received Humboldt Foundation sponsorship as a research fellowship or award.",
            "Missing the publication bar for the career stage, including the requirement for experienced researchers to have acted as thematic lead on important papers.",
            "Not meeting the language requirement for the field.",
            "Applications formally rejected for missing documents or diverging from the specifications, particularly the publication list format.",
            "Expert reviews not uploaded by the reviewers themselves, which prevents submission entirely.",
