          "award_holder_conditions": [
            "You must contribute at least 80% of your research time to the project, and should not spend more than 20% of your time on non-research related activities, or up to 40% on clinical duties if you are in a clinical craft speciality.",
            "You can only hold one of these awards, and Wellcome does not offer renewals.",
            "You can only receive one salary.",
            "Your salary should be based on the pay scales of the host organisation that will employ you, and should not include any potential promotion costs or any Wellcome fellowship supplement that was part of a previous grant.",
            "Your sponsor must guarantee the space and resources you need from the start date to the end date of the award, and must confirm workload expectations with you.",
