            "If your host organisation is in a low- or middle-income country and you will be working in a high-income country for 12 months or more, you should be paid at an appropriate rate for that country.",
            "If, two or more years after activation, your organisation awards you a permanent, open-ended or long-term rolling contract that includes your salary, you may keep the salary element of the award to use towards your remaining research costs."
