          "clinical_restriction": "There is no clinical restriction, but a clinical craft speciality role is treated specially: up to 40% of your time may be spent on clinical duties rather than the standard 20% cap on non-research activities. Health professionals who want to continue clinical activities must be registered with and licensed by the relevant professional regulator in the country they intend to work in.",
          "arrival_rules": [
