      "deadline": "Application Window #1 from January 18 to February 26, 2027. The programme also runs Application Window #2 from March 29 to May 21, 2027. The link to the JJ/WBGSP application form is only communicated to candidates admitted unconditionally (except for funding) to a participating master's programme and shortlisted as eligible by that university.",
      "deadline_date": "2027-02-26",
