            "Upload your letter of admission before submitting the scholarship application.",
            "Submit the scholarship application using the application form link, which is communicated only to candidates who are both unconditionally admitted (except for finance) to a participating programme and shortlisted by the participating university.",
            "If you hold another scholarship or fellowship, send the related documents to the JJ/WBGSP Secretariat."
