            "3. Verify your own eligibility first: listed developing-country nationality, no dual developed-country citizenship, good health, a bachelor's degree earned at least 3 years before the application deadline, and at least 3 years of paid full-time development-related employment acquired within the past 6 years from the deadline.",
            "4. Ask the participating university to shortlist you as an eligible JJ/WBGSP applicant and to confirm which application window applies to your programme's academic calendar.",
