            "7. If you hold any other scholarship or fellowship, send those documents to the JJ/WBGSP Secretariat so the award supplements rather than duplicates them.",
            "8. Await assessment by two independent assessors and the Secretariat's selection, then approval by the JJ/WBGSP Steering Committee; winners are notified soon after approval.",
