          "international_eligibility": "Restricted to Japanese nationals. There is no nationality flexibility in this window: the developing country nationals window of the JJ/WBGSP is a separate scheme with a separate list of eligible countries. Japanese applicants must also not be employed by the Government of Japan or its related agencies - JICA, local governments and the Central Bank - from the date the application process opens, and must not have a World Bank Group role or close-relative relationship from the date the call opens.",
