          "document_audit": [
            "The scheme page publishes no required-document list, file types, file sizes, signatures, translations or date rules. The World Bank states that details on eligibility criteria for each call are provided in that call's Application Guidelines, and that those detailed criteria are strictly adhered to with no exceptions, so the Guidelines are the operative document.",
