          "application_cycle": "2027-2028 cycle: applications open from 20 August 2026, submitted to the applicant's Swiss diplomatic representation with country-specific deadlines published in August 2026, decisions announced by end of May at the latest for the following academic year. Scholarships for 2028-2029 will be advertised online from August 2027.",
