          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "Research scholarships are open to postgraduate researchers in any discipline. Art scholarships are restricted to artistic fields.",
          "application_method": "Online only. Register in Grants Online (GO ESKAS) at go.eskas.ch, sign in and prepare the application; for a research scholarship you must also identify an academic supervisor in Switzerland. Applications must not be sent by e-mail or in paper form. The completed application is submitted to the applicant's Swiss diplomatic representation.",
