          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "No subject restriction. Funding applicants must hold a SEMP Charter or a European Charter for Higher Education, and institutions may optionally apply as a consortium with at least one Swiss higher education institution or college of higher education.",
          "application_method": "Participants: contact the International Relations Office of the home university or college of higher education; the home institution runs the application and selection and pays out the grant. Institutions: apply to Movetia for SEMP accreditation (committing to the SEMP Charter quality criteria), then submit a single annual funding application, optionally forming a consortium.",
