          "official_contacts": {
            "general": "SERI, International Research and Innovation Programmes: Gaétan Lagger, gaetan.lagger@sbfi.admin.ch, +41 58 463 26 74. Movetia, Exchange and mobilities, Effingerstrasse 47, 3008 Bern, +41 31 303 22 00; higher education and higher vocational education unit +41 31 303 22 04",
