          "submission_workflow": [
            "Contact the International Relations Office at your home institution",
            "Confirm SEMP accreditation and an interinstitutional agreement with your chosen host",
            "Submit your application through the home institution by its own deadline",
            "Take part in the home institution's fair and transparent selection process",
            "Validate the learning agreement (or mobility/grant agreement) with both institutions",
            "Submit any special-needs grant request at least two months before departure",
            "Complete the mobility and collect credits/transcripts",
