              "trigger": "Framework change in 2027",
              "message": "Movetia states: 'The Federal Council plans for Switzerland to participate in Erasmus+ from 2027 onwards; the next call for projects will therefore likely be launched within the framework of Erasmus+. Similar projects with comparable procedures should be possible. Detailed information will be published here in autumn 2026.'"
            },
            {
              "trigger": "Grants are paid by institutions, not by Movetia",
              "message": "Official wording: 'SEMP grants can only be paid out by Swiss higher education institutions. Not all institutions offer grants for traineeships.'"
