              "trigger": "Next call timing",
              "message": "Movetia advertises 'Next application deadline: spring 2027 likely under Erasmus+'."
            }
          ],
          "submission_workflow": [
            "Choose a Swiss host institution and check its SEMP accreditation and willingness to host incoming students",
            "Confirm a partnership agreement exists with your home institution",
            "Apply through your home institution so it can nominate you",
            "The Swiss host takes over the coordination of the SEMP application and issues the documents to sign",
            "Sign the learning agreement (or mobility/grant agreement) and the Declaration of Honour",
            "Request the special-needs grant via the International Relations Office at least two months before departure if applicable",
            "Complete the mobility, collect credits and the transcript of records",
            "Submit the experience and final reports through the Swiss institution"
          ]
