          "tuition_coverage": false,
          "tuition_coverage_note": "There is no tuition component. MSCA Postdoctoral Fellowships are research employment grants, not study awards: 'The beneficiary receiving EU funding needs to recruit the researcher for the total period of the fellowship', and the researcher receives a living allowance, a mobility allowance and conditional family, long-term leave and special needs allowances.",
          "living_cost_coverage": true,
