          "international_eligibility": "Explicitly international. The 2027 call page states MSCA Postdoctoral Fellowships 'will be open to excellent researchers of any nationality' and that the scheme is open to researchers wishing to reintegrate in Europe, to those displaced by conflict, and to researchers with high potential seeking to restart their careers in research.",
