          "research_requirement": "Applicants must hold a PhD and develop their own research project jointly with the host organisation; all disciplines are eligible, including Euratom Research and Training Programme areas.",
          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "'All disciplines are eligible for Postdoctoral Fellowships, including research areas covered by the Euratom Research and Training Programme.' The host organisation must be based in an EU Member State or Horizon Europe Associated Country.",
          "application_method": "Researchers develop an application jointly with a chosen host organisation; the host organisation submits the completed proposal, including all annexes, through the EU Funding and Tender Opportunities Portal. Proposals can be submitted at any time from the opening date and must be submitted by the call deadline.",
          "application_route": "EU Funding and Tender Opportunities Portal (Funding & Tenders), with the host organisation submitting on the researcher's behalf. Host organisations can post hosting offers on Euraxess to attract researchers.",
