      "eligibility_summary": "Open to short-cycle, Bachelor's and Master's students and doctoral candidates who are registered at a higher education institution participating in Erasmus+ (holding an Erasmus Charter for Higher Education) and enrolled in studies leading to a recognised degree or tertiary-level qualification. The study period abroad must be relevant to the student's degree-related learning and personal development needs and form part of the study programme they are following.",
