      "application_period": "The 2026 call runs from 28 May 2026 to 24 November 2026, with results notified in April 2027 and the first EU-funded projects starting in August 2027. Doctoral candidates do not apply to the Commission; they apply to funded Doctoral Network projects through the vacancies those projects advertise, including on EURAXESS.",
