          "application_method": "Organisations and consortia develop and submit the proposal with all annexes through the Funding and Tender Opportunities Portal, any time from the call opening date until the deadline. Doctoral candidates do not apply to the Commission: they consult their open vacancies advertised internationally, including on EURAXESS, and apply directly to the institution or project of their choice.",
