            "Attach the admission letter, or a sworn statement for each course choice plus evidence that the admission file is being processed",
            "Email the complete file to the fee.<country>@campusfrance.org address for your country before the deadline",
            "If shortlisted, await embassy pre-selection and the Ministry selection committee",
