      "description": "The Taiwan Scholarship Program is administered by the Ministry of Education of the Republic of China (Taiwan) for outstanding foreign students, and is distinct from the MOFA Taiwan Scholarship and the MOE Huayu Enrichment Scholarship. It pays tuition and miscellaneous expenses up to NTD 40,000 each semester and a monthly living allowance of NTD 15,000 for bachelor's students and NTD 20,000 for master's and doctoral students. Applications go to the Taiwan Representative Office responsible for the applicant's country and a separate application to a Taiwanese university is also required. The 2026 round ran from 1 February to 31 March 2026 and has closed; the next round falls in early 2027.",
