          },
          "description": "The MOE Taiwan Scholarship Program, administered by the Ministry of Education of the Republic of China (Taiwan), encourages outstanding foreign students to undertake degree studies in Taiwan. It pays tuition and miscellaneous expenses up to NTD 40,000 each semester and a monthly living allowance of NTD 15,000 for bachelor's or NTD 20,000 for master's and doctoral students. The scholarship year runs from 1 September to 31 August, with duration of 4 years for bachelor's, 2 years for master's and 4 years for doctoral programmes, capped at five years in total. Applications must be lodged with the Taiwan Representative Office for the applicant's country, and admission to a university or college in Taiwan must be secured separately.",
