      "eligibility_summary": "Applicants must be citizens of an eligible country, hold an undergraduate (first university or bachelor's) degree, have at least five years of full-time professional experience, demonstrate leadership qualities and a record of public service, have limited experience in the United States, and demonstrate English language ability. Applications are submitted through the Binational Fulbright Commission or U.S. Embassy Public Affairs Section in the applicant's country, never directly to the programme site.",
