      "eligibility_summary": "There is no individual application. Eligible secondary schools are invited to nominate a student in the senior class who best exemplifies excellence in leadership, scholarship and citizenship, and the nomination is completed jointly by school officials and the student. For the 2025-26 cycle, 7,697 secondary schools across 85 regions were invited to nominate and 3,289 high school students were nominated.",
