      "deadline": "Two deadlines are published: the UW-Madison International Admissions application is due November 1, 2026, and the Wisconsin Scholarship Hub (WiSH) KMSP Application Portal application is due November 15, 2026. Both apply to KMSP Cohort 11 students beginning studies at UW-Madison in Fall 2027.",
