          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "Most awards cover all HEC Paris programmes. AVENIR, the 30% CLUB Scholarship, the Lafayette Fellowship and the Garzouzi Foundation Scholarship are limited to the Master in Management; the Women in Finance & Technology Scholarship is limited to the Master in International Finance, Master in Economics & Finance, Master in Accounting, Finance and Management, X-HEC Data & Finance and Data Science & AI for Business; Future Leaders of Africa covers all Master's programmes and the MBA.",
          "application_method": "Most merit-based awards require no extra application: 'No application or additional documentation required. All admitted students will be considered automatically.' The four need-based awards all require the Needs-Based Scholarship Form in the HEC Paris Applicant Space, submitted after the initial Master's application. Award-specific essays and documents go to scholarships@hec.fr, and AVENIR is applied for through Campus France.",
