          "application_method": "To be considered, excellent PhD applicants have to be nominated by the Faculty/Department; the application procedures will be advised when the applicants are assessed to be eligible. Applicants may also indicate interest within their admissions application through GradApp. Successful applicants must sign a letter of undertaking agreeing to observe the terms and conditions for the award of the Fellowship.",
          "application_route": "NUS PhD admission application (GradApp) -> faculty/department nomination during admission assessment -> further procedures advised if shortlisted -> sign letter of undertaking.",
