      "eligibility_summary": "For citizens of all countries except Singapore, applying as a freshman to a full-time undergraduate degree programme at NUS with outstanding high school results, strong leadership qualities and potential, and an outstanding co-curricular activities record. Transfer applicants from local or overseas universities are not eligible. Candidates are considered and shortlisted through their application for undergraduate admission to NUS.",
