      "application_period": "The application period is announced by NTU in due course for each Academic Year. Successful candidates are informed of the outcome together with the offer of admissions via email.",
      "eligibility_summary": "Open to all nationalities. Applicants must be outstanding graduates or final-year students taking their first step towards a leading research career by studying full-time for a PhD at NTU, and must hold an Honours (Highest Distinction) or equivalent at Bachelor's level. Candidates who have not yet completed their undergraduate degree must provide official documentation from their university confirming they are on track to graduate with an Honours (Highest Distinction) degree or equivalent.",
      "eligibility": [
        "All nationalities are eligible for the scholarship",
        "An Honours (Highest Distinction) or equivalent at Bachelor's level",
        "Candidates who have not yet completed their undergraduate degree must provide official documentation from their university confirming they are on track to graduate with an Honours (Highest Distinction) degree or equivalent",
        "Must be an outstanding graduate or final-year student taking the first step towards a leading research career by studying full-time for a PhD at NTU"
      ],
      "coverage": [
