          "application_cycle": "Annual, tied to the NTU PhD admission cycle and announced by Academic Year. The application period for Academic Year 2027-2028 had not been announced as at 2026-10-04; the National Institute of Education (NIE) application period is announced separately.",
          "deadline_central": null,
