          "unverified_or_removed_claims": [
            "Funding amount was null in the stored record; the official ISRF Brochure and Announcement publish Rs. 50,000 per month, Rs. 10,000 fellow contingency and Rs. 20,000 host contingency.",
            "Stored program_type 'Science Academies Summer Research Fellowship Program for Students and Teachers â€” 2026' is a different INSA programme and does not describe ISRF; replaced.",
            "Stored degree description 'Postdoctoral / Visiting Researcher (PhD/M.Tech/M.Sc/MBBS with 3-5 years research experience)' is confirmed by the official brochure eligibility text.",
