      "application_period": "Annual, circulated through Indian embassies and Indian missions abroad. Foreign students already in India apply through the university they propose to work with.",
      "eligibility_summary": "Students and teachers from developing countries of Asia, Africa and Latin America. JRF applicants must be 35 (male) or 40 (female) years of age as on 1 July of the year of application and hold at least a high-class master's degree with a second-class bachelor's degree, or a second-class master's degree with a first-class bachelor's degree. RA applicants must be 40 (male) or 45 (female) and hold a doctorate with published and independent research work.",
