      "selection_notes": "Applications go to a short-listing and screening committee, then to a selection committee. UGC conveys provisional intimation only; the formal award letter is issued after political clearance from the Ministry of Home Affairs and the Ministry of External Affairs. UGC reserves the right to withdraw or cancel an award, and the entire fellowship is refunded if the award is discontinued before two years. No TA/DA is provided for interviews.",
