      "deadline": "Official FIRST@IITH deadlines are intake-specific. For the January 2026 intake the page states \"The application deadline was 07-November-2025 17:00 hrs IST\". For the July 2026 intake it states \"The last date to send the application by email is 30-April-2026, 17:00 hrs IST\". Both have passed and no next-intake deadline has been published.",
