      "selection_notes": "The scholarship was established in 2007 with a gift from Rich and Martha Handler, honours Alan and Jane Handler, parents of Richard Handler, and represents the largest scholarship gift in the University's history. Scholars are selected on academic excellence, outstanding potential to be future leaders and demonstrated mastery of complex challenges. Finalists are notified by email in mid-February and attend a mandatory virtual interview event, with recipients notified in late spring. Nominating a student does not guarantee acceptance or receipt of the scholarship, and the award cannot be layered with another University of Rochester institutional merit scholarship.",
