            "Gather parents' and your own income tax documents",
            "Use Harvard's alternate paper financial aid process if you are an international applicant in an exceptional situation such as CSS fee hardship, inability to pay the CSS fee from your country, or unreliable internet access",
            "Report any unusual or changed financial circumstances so they can be considered in the need calculation"
          ],
