      "deadline": "Applications are submitted online to The Rotary Foundation and the global deadline is 15 May. The official application timeline states: \"The 2027-28 Rotary Peace Fellowship application is now closed. The 2028-29 Rotary Peace Fellowship application will be available online in February 2027.\"",
      "deadline_date": null,
      "deadline_precision": "month",
      "application_period": "Annual cycle. Applications open in February and close 15 May; the 2027-28 cycle is closed and the 2028-29 cycle opens in February 2027.",
      "eligibility_summary": "Dedicated leaders with work experience in peace and development who are committed to community and international service. Candidates must not be pursuing doctoral study, and are barred if they are a spouse, lineal descendant, or close blood relative of a current Rotary member, a former Rotary member within 36 months, or a recent Rotary Peace Fellow or Global Grant Scholarship recipient.",
      "eligibility": [
