      "description": "The #YouAreWelcomeHere Scholarship is a coordinated campaign run by NAFSA: Association of International Educators in which each participating U.S. college or university awards two scholarships to first-year international undergraduates. Each award covers at least 50% of the institution's published annual out-of-state tuition, excluding fees, and is renewable for the length of the degree programme provided the student makes satisfactory academic progress. Students apply directly to each institution by that institution's own deadline, which the campaign states is typically in spring or summer for a fall start. Applicants must submit the campaign's scholarship application form plus a 500-1000 word essay or a two-to-five minute video answering a fixed prompt about leadership skills.",
