            "Prepare two reference letters following Radboud's guidelines, preferably academic",
            "Upload your curriculum vitae with the scholarship request",
            "Submit in OSIRIS by 31 January 2027, 23:59 CET, and keep the file complete by 14 February 2027, 23:59 CET",
            "Submit your proof of English proficiency before 14 February 2027"
          ],
