      "eligibility_summary": "Non-EU/EEA, non-Swiss, non-Surinam applicants admitted to a participating full-time Maastricht University master's programme for 2027-2028, with a GPA of at least 7.5 out of 10, aged 35 or under on 1 September 2027, who have never studied in a Dutch degree programme.",
