      "eligibility_summary": "Applicants must hold a non-EU/EEA passport and not be eligible for the lower Dutch tuition fee, prove academic excellence equivalent to a Dutch grade 8, and hold a conditional or unconditional offer for the first year of a full-time English-taught VU Amsterdam Master's programme starting September 2027. February starters, joint programmes VU does not administer, and applicants with a Dutch degree or current Dutch enrolment are excluded.",
