          "deadline_central_timezone": "Europe/Warsaw",
          "deadline_note": "The official Rector's Scholarship page gives a fixed recurring annual deadline of 20 October but attaches no calendar year, so no exact ISO date can be recorded. The International Students news page documents the last published cycle (2025/2026) as 1-20 October with an electronic form. A 2026/2027 schedule had not been published on the pages read on 2026-10-04.",
          "status": "OPEN",
