          "funding_label": "Monthly merit stipend paid October-June; the amount for each academic year is set by the Rector in consultation with the University Student Government Economic Committee and published in the site's News section (amount not published on the pages read). It is a cash benefit, not a tuition waiver.",
          "benefits": [
