          "selection_weighting": "Points-based ranking; maximum 10% of students in a given programme/specialisation may be awarded. Tie-breaks in order: points for academic/artistic/sports achievements, ECTS credits obtained, grade average over the whole course of studies, and for first-year second-cycle students the admission result. Only achievements and grades from the previous academic year count.",
          "duration": "One academic year, in principle nine months (October to June)",
