      "eligibility_summary": "Open to applicants enrolled in, or meeting the requirements to enrol in, a PhD programme leading to a doctoral degree. Portuguese citizens, EU member state citizens, third-state citizens, stateless citizens and beneficiaries of political refugee status may all apply. Applicants must not previously have held an FCT-funded PhD studentship or PhD in Industry studentship, must not already hold a doctoral degree, and must live in Portugal permanently and habitually if applying for a studentship based both in Portugal and abroad or entirely abroad.",
