          "international_eligibility": "The Merit, Social Mobility and Continuity Scholarships are explicitly open to all candidates regardless of country of origin, with income documents from outside Portugal accepted in Portuguese or English with a certified translation. Partner scholarships are more restrictive and are not available to all international applicants.",
