            "Read the Embassy announcement to confirm your nationality and degree level are eligible",
            "Open www.campuschina.org and register or sign in to the CSC account",
            "Select the Chinese Government Scholarship (Type A) programme and the specific Chinese universities and programmes",
            "Upload the documents the portal requires and check every field before final submission",
            "Submit before the published deadline and save the CSC confirmation reference",
            "Track the outcome through the CSC portal rather than the Embassy website"
