          "description": "The Embassy of the People's Republic of China in the Republic of Indonesia opened applications for the 2026/2027 Chinese Government Scholarship, including the China-Indonesia Scholarship in Higher Education Program offering 20 places for undergraduate, master's and doctoral programmes in China, focused on marine, medical, health, tourism, education and other required majors. The award is a full scholarship that does not include international travel expenses. Applicants submit the online application and all documents through the China Scholarship Council system at www.campuschina.org under agency number 3602 before February 8, 2026, with the Embassy forwarding recommended applications to the Council between February 9 and March 5, 2026 and results visible in the system from July to August 2026.",
