      "eligibility_summary": "Early-stage researchers who hold a completed Master's degree (or equivalent) qualifying for doctoral studies, dated on the certificate by the call deadline, do not already hold a PhD, have less than four years of full-time-equivalent research experience after the Master's degree, are not permanently employed by the University of Helsinki, satisfy the MSCA mobility rule, and are willing to reside in Finland for the full four years.",
