          },
          "description": "The Padua International Excellence Scholarship Programme offers up to 76 scholarships to brilliant international students entering an English-taught first-cycle or master's degree at the University of Padua. Each scholarship is worth €8,000.00 gross per academic year plus exemption from student fees, with beneficiaries paying only the regional fee and revenue stamp. Awards last a maximum of two years on master's courses and three years on bachelor's or single-cycle courses, paid in two instalments of €4,000.00, and are retained only if at least 20 CFU are earned by 30 November each year. There is no separate scholarship application: applying to the degree course within the admission deadline makes the candidate eligible automatically.",
