      "eligibility_summary": "Applicants must hold a non-EEA nationality, have completed (or be due to complete before the Master's starts) their most recent degree in a designated eligible country, be applying for a regular one-year Tilburg Master's programme starting September 2027, have submitted both the programme application and the waiver form by 1 April 2027, be directly admitted rather than entering through a Pre-Master's, be in their first Master's programme at Tilburg University, and hold no other tuition-fee waiver.",
