          "deadline_note": "There are two sequential official deadlines, not one. First the OSIRIS application must be submitted by 31 January 2027 23:59 CET; Radboud then returns it for payment of the handling fee and any corrections. Second, the application must be complete by 14 February 2027 23:59 CET, and \"incomplete applications will not be considered for the scholarship selection\". The university recommends lodging proof of English proficiency before 14 February 2027 as well. The central deadline is taken as the first, OSIRIS submission date; the second is captured in deadline_note and the applicant utility block.",
          "status": "OPEN",
          "status_note": "Applications for the September 2027 intake are open as of 2026-10-04, with the first deadline on 31 January 2027. The scholarship and admission to the Master's programme are two separate processes.",
