          "citizenship_residency": "Applicants must hold a non-EU/non-EEA passport and must not qualify for the lower EU/EEA tuition fee for other reasons. The scholarship is open to all non-EU/non-EEA countries; no separate residency condition is published.",
          "international_eligibility": "Open to applicants from all non-EU/non-EEA countries whose Bachelor's degree was obtained outside the Netherlands and who have no prior education in the Netherlands. Applicants must be able to comply with Dutch visa conditions.",
