          "english_requirement_note": "The official pages read do not set a single English test requirement for the general programme. English proficiency matters indirectly: the Merit Scholarship Program awards a doubled stipend to students with high scores in the international language proficiency examinations determined by the Presidency, and a one-year Turkish language course is provided.",
