      "deadline_date": null,
      "deadline_precision": "recurring",
      "application_period": "Annual campaign for students finishing their terminale year in a French school abroad. The 2026 cycle ran from 16 February to 12 March 2026 for online submission via the Cascade application, with the AEFE selection commission in May 2026 and entry at the start of the 2026-2027 school year.",
      "application_method": [
