      ],
      "eligibility_summary": "For the best non-French students in the final year (terminale) of a recognised French school abroad. Applicants must not hold French nationality, must be enrolled in terminale at a homologued French establishment abroad, must have excellent school results, must have an orientation project in French higher education leading to a state-recognised diploma, must want to commit to demanding studies from the baccalaureat onwards, must submit Parcoursup wishes identical to those in the application, and must show genuine motivation and adaptability for life in France. Definitive award also requires a baccalaureat with a 'tres bien' mention and confirmed enrolment in the announced track.",
