      "deadline": "There is no separate scholarship application or scholarship deadline: the official page states \"please indicate your interest in the Scholarship section of the online application form for admission. There is no separate scholarship application form.\" The scholarship therefore follows the SMU undergraduate admission closing date. The official SMU 'Important Dates' page last published \"Application Opening Date 17 November 2025 12.00pm, Singapore Standard Time\" and \"Application Closing Date 19 March 2026 11.59pm, Singapore Standard Time\" for Academic Year 2026-27; dates for the next intake were not published as at 2026-10-04.",
