      "eligibility_summary": "Open to full-time SMU first-year undergraduate students of any nationality, with the option of enrolling in a single degree or a double degree programme. Scholars must take a second major (or, for the Bachelor of Integrative Studies, meet an equivalent requirement), must demonstrate leadership and communications skills, and must have a substantial record of co-curricular activity and/or community service involvement.",
