        },
        "applicant_utility": {
          "application_readiness_checklist": [
            "Apply for a graduate research course at Melbourne by that course's own application closing date - that date, not a scholarship date, is what gets you considered",
            "Save the automatic-consideration confirmation you receive within seven days of your course application, in case an enrolling Faculty asks for evidence later",
            "Check the three award forms (Fee Offset, Stipend, combined) and work out which your circumstances qualify for",
            "Confirm your expected degree level, since the fee offset runs up to two years for a Masters by Research and up to four years for a doctorate",
            "If you are an international student needing a student visa, note that OSHC Single Membership comes with the Stipend award",
            "If you move to Melbourne, budget for the one-off relocation allowance of $2,000 interstate or $3,000 from outside Australia",
            "Read the Graduate Research Scholarships Terms & Conditions, since the awards are subject to them as amended"
          ],
          "common_rejection_risks": [
            "Missing the application closing date of the specific graduate research course, which is the only date that matters for automatic consideration",
            "Trying to apply for the scholarship separately and assuming a separate form exists",
            "Assuming domestic and international students compete in the same pool - the University states domestic students receive an RTP Scholarship (Fee Offset) with their course offer",
            "Not factoring selection is a ranking against other high-achieving applicants on both prior academic results and research potential",
            "Assuming a deferred commencement or a currently enrolled candidate is automatically reconsidered, when the enrolling Faculty sets its own process",
            "Overestimating the stipend duration: 3.5 years for a doctorate, not 4, and 2 years for a Masters by Research"
          ],
          "estimated_uncovered_costs": [
            "Books, equipment and consumables are not listed as benefits of this scholarship",
            "Health costs beyond OSHC Single Membership",
            "Visa application and related charges are not listed as benefits",
            "Fees for periods beyond the stated offsets and stipend duration (for example beyond 3.5 years of stipend for a doctorate) are not covered",
            "Living costs beyond the published stipend rate, which is indexed annually and so may not keep pace with actual costs"
