          "submission_workflow": [
            "Choose a graduate research course at the University of Melbourne and note its application closing date",
            "Submit your course application before that closing date",
            "Check for the automatic-consideration confirmation within seven days",
            "Do not submit a separate scholarship application unless your enrolling Faculty requires it for a deferred or current-student reassessment",
            "Wait for the faculty selection panel ranking, which weighs academic results for previous study and research potential",
            "If offered, accept the scholarship together with or alongside your course offer and the commencement deposit conditions",
            "On enrolment, the fee offset and stipend components are applied for the periods stated for your degree level",
            "Maintain Satisfactory Academic Standing and comply with the Graduate Research Scholarships Terms & Conditions"
