      "selection_notes": "Selection is by the Scholarships Committee on academic merit and research potential; applications are scored on academic merit, academic research training merit and research outputs (maximum 5 publications). The University gives priority to students undertaking a higher degree by research for the first time. Applicants for the AGRTPS are automatically considered for the FIPRS, and the highest ranked eligible applicants are offered an AGRTPS, with FIPRS awards going to the next highest ranked eligible applicants.",
