      "description": "The FWF ASTRA Awards are a career funding programme launched in July 2024 for advanced postdocs in Austria who already have experience with independent research (R3 level). The FWF awards between EUR 500,000 and EUR 1 million per project over five years, plus an additional EUR 200,000 tenure package for female principal investigators who secure a permanent position within the first three years. The programme is decided by the FWF Scientific Board on the recommendation of an international jury following peer review and a hearing, with about 18 awards per call and half of them awarded to women. Proposals are submitted through the elane portal during a published annual application window, which was closed on the verification date.",
