      "selection_notes": "From the time of application (1 March or 1 September) the three-stage application process takes four to five months. Funding usually starts at the beginning of the winter term (applying by 1 March) or at the beginning of the summer semester (applying by 1 September), or somewhat earlier for PhD students.",
