      "notes": "The scheme has two tiers. The full scholarship covers tuition waiver, application fee waiver, monthly stipend, basic accommodation and medical insurance. The partial scholarship covers only items a), d) and e) - that is, the tuition waiver, medical insurance and application fee - so it carries no stipend and no accommodation.",
      "eligibility_summary": "Applicants must not hold Chinese citizenship, must hold a valid foreign passport, must be proficient in English or Chinese, must meet UCAS admission criteria for international students, and must not hold another assignment during the scholarship period. Age limits apply by programme.",
