      "last_verified_date": "2026-10-04",
      "description": "ITALYOU is a scholarship programme of the Italian Ministry of Foreign Affairs and International Cooperation (MAECI), run with the University for Foreigners of Perugia, that funds the ItAS master's degree course 'ItAS - Italian for Teaching to Foreigners'. It targets young scholars from selected African countries. The fourth edition covers academic year 2026-2027 and awards 70 new annual scholarships of EUR 8,000 each, paid in 12 monthly instalments starting 1 October 2026, plus 64 renewals for third-edition holders who have passed at least 40 CFU. Selection is coordinated by the University for Foreigners of Perugia with its partner institutions and the Italian diplomatic missions in each target country.",
      "program_type": "Master's degree scholarship programme (ItAS - Italian for Teaching to Foreigners)",
      "duration": "One academic year, disbursed in 12 monthly instalments",
      "application_period": "Annual edition. The 4th edition covers academic year 2026-2027, with scholarships starting 1 October 2026.",
