        "For faculty schemes that use the Amsterdam Merit Scholarship, the application is normally part of the Master's programme application, where applicants indicate they wish to be considered for a scholarship"
      ],
      "selection_notes": "The UvA describes the Amsterdam Merit Scholarship as highly selective and states that only applicants with excellent study results and motivation might be eligible to receive it. Selection, award volumes and assessment criteria are set and published by each faculty, and the Faculty of Science states it selects in March and informs applicants in April.",
      "program_type": "University scholarship programmes for international students (Amsterdam Merit Scholarship plus faculty-specific schemes)",
