      "eligibility_summary": "Applicants must be enrolled or in the process of enrolling in full-time study or training with a New Zealand tertiary provider, be a New Zealand citizen or permanent resident, have lived in New Zealand for the last three years, be of indigenous Pacific cultural heritage, and have completed NCEA 3 or equivalent and be 16 or over when the course starts (or 18 or over if already out of secondary school). New-to-study applicants must have done no more than 0.5 equivalent full-time student load of tertiary education; continuing-study applicants must have completed at least one year of study or be entering a second or subsequent year.",
