          "description": "The SUTD Trailblazers Scholarship is a SUTD-administered undergraduate scholarship, listed as new in AY2025, for Singapore Citizen applicants with outstanding academic qualifications who show strong leadership and a strong co-curricular or community record. It covers subsidised tuition fees after the Tuition Grant for up to four years, pays an annual allowance of S$6,000 (S$3,000 per academic term), and adds a travel award of up to S$5,000 for approved overseas programmes. No bond is attached, but the recipient must take up the Tuition Grant Scheme.",
