      "eligibility_summary": "Exclusively for students who have graduated from a foreign university with a qualification equivalent to a Swiss bachelor's degree (180 ECTS) and with outstanding academic results, who are not currently enrolled at UNIL, who hold at least C1 in the language of the chosen programme, and who have paid the CHF 200 administrative fee.",
      "eligibility": [
        "Hold a foreign university degree recognised as equivalent to a Swiss university bachelor's degree (180 ECTS credits) before starting the Master's programme at UNIL",
        "Have achieved outstanding academic results during those studies",
        "Hold a minimum C1 level in French for programmes taught in French, or in English for programmes taught in English",
        "Not be currently enrolled at UNIL",
        "Have paid the non-refundable administrative fee of CHF 200",
        "Not have already begun a Master's programme at UNIL, and not be in the preparatory year",
        "Applicants who already hold a foreign master's degree may apply, but priority is given to applicants holding only a bachelor's degree"
