          "international_eligibility": "Open to nationals of CERN Member and Associate Member States other than Pakistan, Lithuania, Latvia, Cyprus, Croatia and Turkey while the Article II.5 ceiling is reached. Nationals of non-member states are handled through a separate 'possible recruitment of non-member state nationals' mechanism.",
