          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "The vacancy field matters, because the research-experience cap differs: 6 years for Theoretical and Experimental Physics versus 3 years for Applied Sciences and Engineering. The page lists vacancies under Applied Physics, Experimental Physics, Theoretical Physics, Chemical/Materials and Process Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Electronics Engineering and Information Technologies.",
