      "selection_notes": "Each ANU College convenes a selection committee to score and rank all eligible H1 (or equivalent) applicants in a merit-based process. Overall ranking considers academic record, research potential (including support from the prospective supervisor and the location in which research will be undertaken), referee reports, English language competency, and comparison with other applications received in the same scholarship round. Continuation is based on academic performance and a 6 month extension is available.",
