              "trigger": "Deadline is relative, not calendar",
              "message": "\"email it to Deakin International Admissions at least one month before your program starts\". Work back from your own program start date, because Deakin publishes no fixed closing date and only says assessments run on a rolling basis in the lead-up to each trimester."
            },
            {
              "trigger": "VCPEP is compulsory",
              "message": "\"Participation in the Vice-Chancellor's Professional Excellence Program (VCPEP), a requirement of the scholarship\" - this is a condition of the award, not an optional extra."
            },
            {
              "trigger": "Outcome is 100% or 50%",
              "message": "\"100% or 50% of your tuition fees (depending on scholarship outcome)\". Do not plan a budget that assumes full fee coverage."
            },
            {
              "trigger": "Minimum criteria are not enough",
              "message": "\"Meeting the minimum criteria does not guarantee selection. Due to strong competition, higher academic results may be required.\""
            },
            {
              "trigger": "Extra and repeated units excluded",
              "message": "\"Additional fees may apply. The scholarship will not cover study beyond the standard program duration, including extra or repeated units.\" This bites if you add units or repeat a failed subject."
            },
            {
              "trigger": "Only successful applicants hear back",
              "message": "\"Only successful applicants will be contacted with an outcome\" - there is no rejection notification, so silence is not a decision."
            }
          ],
          "submission_workflow": [
            "Confirm eligibility: new international student, non-excluded coursework degree, 85% average or equivalent",
            "Meet the program's entry and English language requirements",
            "Apply for your Deakin degree through the international student application route",
            "Complete the International Scholarship Program application form",
            "Write the 300-word personal statement in your own voice",
            "Obtain two references focused on community involvement and/or leadership",
            "Attach your program application and academic transcripts",
            "Email the package to Deakin International Admissions at least one month before your program starts",
            "Await a rolling assessment in the lead-up to the trimester; attend an interview if invited",
            "On success, accept the acceptance form terms including VCPEP participation"
