      "english_requirement": "Applicants must in principle be willing to carry out their academic studies in Japan in Japanese. MEXT provides one year of preparatory Japanese language education before university enrolment for grantees who attend a preparatory educational institution. Japanese or English proficiency certificates are optional and must have been issued no earlier than two years before the date of application to the diplomatic mission.",
      "requirements": [
