      "description": "Japanese Government (MEXT) Scholarship for students from abroad who wish to pursue research study at a Japanese university under the university-recommendation route, meaning the accepting university nominates the student to MEXT. The monthly allowance depends on the course enrolled in: JPY 117,000 for regular students in bachelor degree courses, JPY 144,000 for master's or professional degree courses and JPY 145,000 for doctoral courses, with a supplemental regional allowance of JPY 2,000 or JPY 3,000 per month in specially designated regions. Entrance examination, matriculation and tuition fees must be paid by the accepting university, and MEXT stipulates the travel route and provides an economy-class airline ticket. The scholarship period is the necessary period for completion of the relevant regular course.",
