      "application_period": "Annual embassy-recommendation round. For the 2026 cycle MEXT published the guidelines in December 2025, diplomatic missions screened candidates in early 2026, placement was confirmed by 14 August 2026, and the scholarship period began in October 2026.",
      "eligibility_summary": "Students aged 18 to 30 who, at the time of travelling to Japan and of returning home, are enrolled in the faculty of a university outside Japan and major in Japanese language or Japanese culture. They must have completed at least one cumulative year of Japanese language or Japanese culture study as of 1 September 2026, must not be graduating before September 2027, must not already have held a MEXT scholarship, and cannot apply at the same time as any other MEXT scholarship programme.",
