      "english_requirement": "Japanese is the working language of the programme: the First Screening at the diplomatic mission includes a written Japanese examination, and the training courses at the accepting universities are taught in Japanese. All application documents must be prepared in Japanese or English, with a Japanese or English translation attached if the original is in another language.",
