      "english_requirement": "The programme leads to a master's course at a Japanese graduate school. MEXT's official portal lists Japanese language or Japanese culture training only for the Japanese studies students category; for YLP no MEXT-level examination subject is listed in the embassy-recommendation examination table, because YLP is not embassy-recommended. Language requirements therefore come from the target graduate school and the recruiting embassy.",
