          "region": "Asia",
          "coverage": "Monthly stipend only. JASSO lists no tuition waiver and no travel funding for this programme.",
          "last_verified_date": "2026-10-04"
        },
        "applicant_utility": {
          "application_readiness_checklist": [
            "Secure pre-arrival admission first; this reservation programme only applies to students who already have it",
            "Check that your school and department appear on JASSO's eligible list for the reservation category (graduate level, EJU exam, or English courses) and for your enrolment cycle",
            "Ask the school's international office specifically about the MEXT Honors Scholarship reservation programme, since JASSO takes no direct applications",
            "Prepare evidence of financial difficulty and your academic and character records",
            "Confirm your enrolment month, because the support period is 12 months for April enrolment and only 6 months for September or October enrolment",
            "Budget around the JPY 48,000 per month stipend, which does not cover tuition"
          ],
