      "eligibility_summary": "Applicants must be nominated by the responsible Sending Partner (for example the Hungarian Embassy, the relevant ministry or council in their country) and may apply only to study programmes supported by the cooperation agreement between Hungary and their country or region. Selection requires nomination by the sending partner, a successful institutional entrance examination scoring at least 56 out of 100 points, and the agreed minimum credit requirement.",
