      "eligibility_summary": "Applicants must be a Canadian citizen, Permanent Resident or Protected Person under subsection 95(2) of the Immigration and Refugee Protection Act (Canada) by the student deadline set by each graduate unit, or an international student studying or planning to study at U of T under a temporary resident visa (student study permit), for whom a limited number of OGS awards are available and whose valid study permits must be effective as of the graduate unit's OGS international application deadline. Applicants must be registered or intend to register full-time in 2026-2027 in an eligible two- or three-term graduate programme, must not have exceeded the lifetime maximum of government-funded support, and must have achieved at least A- (or equivalent) in each of the last two completed years of study.",
