          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "Preselection by a participating Quebec university, the CCTT network, or the China Scholarship Council. Institutions may recommend a maximum of 16 applications across the four all-countries components depending on application quality and component needs; the bilateral components have per-institution quotas.",
          "application_method": "Two-stage institutional process. Institutions or the CCTT network transmit nominations of preselected candidates electronically through FRQnet by their deadline. Preselected candidates then create an FRQnet account, are contacted by FRQ, complete an electronic form with all required documents attached, and submit it electronically before the competition deadline. For postdoctoral and short-term components the supervisor submits a letter of acceptance directly through the FRQnet portal.",
