            "Decide which call to target: the spring call runs through Tutkijat maailmalle (March to April), the autumn call through the Foundation's own system (August to 15 September)"
          ],
          "common_rejection_risks": [
            "Missing the host's invitation letter, which must be included in the application",
            "Research outside the Fund's three named ICT focus areas",
            "Not based at a Finnish university, or too senior for the postdoctoral to assistant professor target group",
            "Planning the visit before completing a doctoral degree when the applicant only has permission to defend",
            "Omitting the progress report on a previous or ongoing grant for a second or third year application",
            "Writing a budget that treats the grant as a salary replacement; it is not"
          ],
          "estimated_uncovered_costs": [
            "Your own salary at your home institution, which the grant explicitly does not cover",
            "Any tuition or enrolment fees at the host, which the official page does not mention",
            "Funding beyond one year at a time, which requires reapplying and is not guaranteed",
            "Proportional reduction if your visit is shorter than 12 months"
          ],
          "document_audit": [
