      "description": "The Mastercard Foundation Scholars Program at Sciences Po is the first such programme in continental Europe and supports students from the African continent who wish to pursue a two-year Master's degree at Sciences Po, covering the full financial needs of selected Scholars. Applicants must first be declared eligible and receive an application fee waiver, then apply and be admitted through the International Graduate Admissions Procedure, and finally be selected by the Programme's Selection Committee. For the 2027 intake the fee-waiver window runs from October to mid-December 2026, while the scholarship application timeline itself had not been published on the page as of 4 October 2026. Shortlisted admitted candidates are invited to a roughly 25-minute online interview conducted by Zoom.",
