      "is_verified": true,
      "last_verified_date": "2026-10-04",
      "region": "Europe",
      "duration": "1 to 3 months of secondment to a Dutch diplomatic mission, within the fellowship period 1 March 2027 to 29 February 2028",
      "deadline": "10 September 2026 before 14:00:00 CEST - Deadline for proposals. Proposals submitted after the deadline will not be taken into consideration by NWO.",
      "deadline_date": null,
      "deadline_precision": "recurring",
      "application_period": "2027 cycle: informative webinar 2 July 2026, proposal deadline 10 September 2026 14:00 CEST, decision by November 2026, fellowship period 1 March 2027 to 29 February 2028",
      "eligibility_summary": "PhD graduates at a listed Dutch research organisation, and 'lectoren' and senior researchers at universities of applied sciences, whose contract runs at least until the end of the fellowship period. Researchers whose PhD date is fixed but who have not yet obtained the degree may submit, provided they hold the degree at the start of the fellowship. Applicants may apply for a maximum of one of the 12 mission positions.",
      "eligibility": [
        "Be a PhD graduate at a listed research organisation: a Dutch university or university of applied sciences, a university medical centre, a KNAW or NWO institute, the Netherlands Cancer Institute, the Max Planck Institute for Psycholinguistics, Naturalis Biodiversity Center, ARCNL, the Princess Máxima Center, IHE Delft Institute for Water Education, or a TO2 institution",
        "Be a 'lecten' or senior researcher at a university of applied sciences",
        "Have an employment contract running at least until the end of the fellowship period",
        "Researchers who have not yet obtained their PhD but whose PhD date is fixed may apply, provided the degree is obtained at the start of the fellowship",
        "Apply for no more than one of the 12 selected positions",
        "Be available during the fellowship period of 1 March 2027 to 29 February 2028"
      ],
      "coverage": [
        "International travel expenses for economy class air travel or train fares",
        "Accommodation expenses",
        "Research expenses, including domestic travel, representation expenses and costs for meetings",
        "Replacement grant"
      ],
      "required_documents": [
        "Motivation letter in PDF, maximum 2 x A4 in Calibri font size 10 with normal margins and single line spacing, including a provisional working plan",
        "Narrative CV in PDF, maximum 500 words",
        "Key outputs in PDF, maximum 5 items, with one hyperlink per item",
        "Budget form in Excel using the standard format provided",
        "Signed statement by the main applicant, as required in Isaac"
      ],
      "catalogue_url": null,
      "official_updates_url": "https://www.nwo.nl/en/calls",
      "english_requirement": "The proposal is written in English.",
      "requirements": [
        "Submit the complete application in the Isaac application and reporting system",
        "Create an Isaac account at least one workday in advance if you do not have one",
        "Use the current budget form: on 12-08-2026 the budget form was replaced with a new version",
        "State in the motivation letter which fellowship you are interested in, why you are suitable, what value you bring, and your availability between 1 March 2027 and 29 February 2028",
        "State your approach to involving relevant local partners and stakeholders in the research",
        "Do not mention h-indexes, journal impact factors or any other indicator of general journal or publisher reputation",
        "Submit before the deadline, since late proposals will not be considered"
      ],
      "application_method": [
        "Register or create an Isaac account at least one workday in advance",
        "Download the current forms from Isaac and use them",
        "Write the motivation letter, narrative CV, key outputs and budget form",
