        "Submit before 10 September 2026, 14:00 CEST"
      ],
      "selection_notes": "Proposals are assessed against three weighted criteria: quality and motivation of the applicant (40%), match between the applicant and the assignment as formulated by the mission (40%), and feasibility (20%). Because of the expertise on the assessment committee and the small size of the grant, NWO applies Article 2.2.4 second subsection of the NWO Grant Rules 2024 and assesses proposals without involving referees. The assessment consists of an assessment committee meeting in October 2026 and decision-making by the NWO Executive Board in November 2026.",
