      "duration": "Not specified on the official pages read; mobility periods are agreed bilaterally between the sending and receiving institutions",
      "deadline": "No central deadline is published on study.gov.pl or on the Polish National Agency's site. Erasmus+ calls are announced nationally by the Foundation for the Development of the Education System and by each sending or receiving university, so the deadline varies by institution and call.",
