      "deadline": "Most IMD MBA scholarships are open throughout 2026, available until allocated. The BackPack Scholarship for Women has a fixed deadline of 14 July. Bursary applications follow the admissions application deadline.",
      "deadline_date": null,
      "deadline_precision": "varies",
      "application_period": "Scholarships: throughout 2026 until allocated, except the BackPack Scholarship for Women which closes on 14 July. Bursaries: the same deadline as the admissions application.",
      "eligibility_summary": "Candidates who have applied for and accepted an offer to join the IMD MBA programme. Individual scholarships impose additional criteria, including academic and professional excellence evidenced by GPA or equivalent and GMAT/GRE scores, career progression and international exposure, performance during the Assessment Day, and in several cases gender, STEM background or nationality/disadvantage criteria. Bursaries are awarded on proven financial need with good academic results, a strong reference letter and steady career progression.",
      "eligibility": [
        "Must have applied for and accepted an offer to join the IMD MBA programme",
        "Excellence in previous academic and/or professional endeavours, including GPA or equivalent and GMAT/GRE scores",
