          "deadline_central_timezone": "Europe/Zurich",
          "deadline_note": "There is no single central date. Five of the six named scholarships are open throughout 2026 on an available-until-allocated basis, the BackPack Scholarship for Women has a fixed 14 July deadline printed without a year, and bursaries follow the admissions application deadline. The 14 July date has passed relative to 2026-10-04 and carries no year on the page, so deadline_date is null and precision is varies.",
