      "deadline_date": null,
      "deadline_precision": "rolling",
      "application_period": "Continuous, per vacancy. Positions are announced through calls for expressions of interest on WIPO's Taleo career site and on LinkedIn, so there is no single application window.",
      "eligibility_summary": "At least a first-level university degree such as a bachelor's. Depending on the fellowship category there may be additional requirements, such as a minimum level of professional experience, an advanced degree such as a Master's or PhD, or specific competencies. There is no age limit and no limit on how long ago a candidate graduated. Former interns may apply if they meet the criteria, but Young Experts Program participants may not apply for any WIPO position within one year of completing the programme.",
      "eligibility": [
        "At least a first-level university degree, for example a bachelor's degree",
