          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "Category-specific. Translation fellows: assistant terminologists, translators, post-editors, translation technologists and technical specialists, in the PCT Translation and Terminology Fellowship Program. Legal case manager fellows: young law graduates, in the WIPO Domain Name Fellowship Program. Visiting and research fellows: individuals with a background in economics or statistics, in the Research and Visiting Fellowship Program. Other specialized fellows: varied educational and professional backgrounds.",
