          "region": "Europe",
          "coverage": "Monthly stipend of CHF 3,000 to CHF 8,000 plus insurance largely paid by WIPO, relocation travel at the start and end of the fellowship, paid leave and training. Remuneration for work rather than funding of a degree.",
