            "Identify which of the four fellow categories fits your background: translation, law and domain names, economics or statistics, or another specialism",
            "Check the category-specific extras in the individual call, which may be a minimum level of professional experience, a Master's or PhD, or specific competencies",
            "If you completed the WIPO Young Experts Program, wait out the one-year bar before applying for any WIPO position",
            "Set up alerts on WIPO's Taleo career site and follow WIPO on LinkedIn, since calls for expressions of interest are the only route in",
            "Budget for Geneva living costs against a stipend that could be at either end of the CHF 3,000 to CHF 8,000 range",
            "Prepare for relocation: WIPO covers travel at the start and end and helps with visa formalities"
          ],
          "common_rejection_risks": [
