          "description": "The QUT International Merit Scholarship is a high-achievement award for future international undergraduate and postgraduate students. QUT's own international student scholarships hub states that it covers 25% of tuition fees for the full duration of the program provided the recipient meets the minimum academic standards of the course, and that it is available in selected faculties only. Recipients on the QUT site include students of the Bachelor of Information Technology (Computer Science), the Master of Architecture and the Master of Business (International Business), confirming it spans both undergraduate and postgraduate study.",
