      "deadline_precision": "recurring",
      "application_period": "One call per academic year. For the winter semester 2026/27 intake the call was announced on 13 April 2026 (No. 16/2026) and has already closed; the next annual call is expected in spring 2027 for the 2027/28 winter semester.",
      "eligibility_summary": "Open to citizens of the 36 countries covered by Polish Aid, from Eastern Europe, Asia, Africa and Latin America, applying for full-time second-cycle (master's) studies in Polish or English at universities supervised by the Minister of Science and Higher Education. The full list of eligible countries is published in the call announcement.",
      "eligibility": [
        "Citizens of one of the 36 countries covered by Polish Aid, located in Eastern Europe, Asia, Africa or Latin America",
        "Admission to full-time second-cycle (master's) studies conducted in Polish or English",
