      "eligibility_summary": "Citizens of Albania, Armenia, Azerbaijan, Belarus, Bosnia and Herzegovina, Georgia, Kosovo, Moldova, Montenegro, North Macedonia, Serbia and Ukraine may apply. All applicants must have completed at least four semesters of university studies, and the award is for master's and post-master's students and researchers for up to two semesters at institutions in Central and Eastern Europe.",
