          "citizenship_residency": "Citizenship of an ASEAN Member State, a Pacific Island Country or Mongolia, plus full-time enrolment at a post-secondary institution in that eligible country and payment of tuition fees to it throughout the exchange. Applicants must not hold or have applied for Canadian citizenship or permanent residency, and must not already be enrolled in a Canadian post-secondary programme.",
          "international_eligibility": "This is exclusively an international scholarship: 30 eligible countries of origin (11 ASEAN Member States including Timor-Leste, 15 Pacific Island Countries, and Mongolia). Canadian host institutions must be Designated Learning Institutions.",
