          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "The project must fall within applied monetary economics, macroeconomics, macroeconomic policy, public finance or public finance policy. The Willem F. Duisenberg Fellowship Foundation gives particular priority to researchers with an outstanding record in applied monetary economics, macroeconomics or public finance.",
