      "duration": "3 to 10 months of exchange within a CEEPUS network",
      "deadline": "The programme's own site announced on 21 September 2026 that the 'Network Application Round 2027/28' is enabled with a 'Deadline: 30th November, 2026, 23:59 CET' and an 'Extended deadline for signed documents (letters): 15th December, 2026, 23:59 CET'. That is the network (institution) application round; the student scholarship call runs separately per network and per direction, and no central student deadline is published on the pages read.",
      "deadline_date": null,
      "deadline_precision": "varies",
      "application_period": "Annual cycles. The network application round for 2027/28 closed on 30 November 2026 (signed letters by 15 December 2026); student scholarship calls follow the network rounds and are announced per network.",
      "eligibility_summary": "Exchange students must be nationals of a CEEPUS country and must apply within a network that links at least three higher education institutions from at least two CEEPUS contractual countries. CEEPUS unites universities from 16 Central and Eastern European countries. Incoming students are exempted from tuition fees and receive a grant from the host country sized according to local living costs.",
      "eligibility": [
        "National of a CEEPUS country",
        "Enrolled at a higher education institution that participates in a CEEPUS network",
        "Applying within a network of at least three institutions from at least two different CEEPUS contractual countries"
