          "deadline_note": "The only exact date published on the programme's own site is the 2027/28 Network Application Round deadline of 30 November 2026 (with signed letters by 15 December 2026). That round is for institutions joining networks, not for students, so it is not recorded as this scholarship's deadline. The student scholarship deadline is set per network and per direction, hence deadline_precision 'varies' and deadline_date null.",
