      "application_period": "A fixed annual window. The published Academic Year 2026/2027 window opened on 1 July 2026 and was extended to 15 September 2026, and the page states applications may be submitted before final cumulative GPA and examination results are received.",
      "eligibility_summary": "Singapore Citizens who are a local polytechnic graduate or are graduating from a local polytechnic, accepted or planning to enrol in a STEM undergraduate course at an overseas university, excluding Medicine and Dentistry, with a Gross Monthly Household Income of S$15,000 or less at the point of admission, and who demonstrate a commitment to contributing to the STEM economy in Singapore. Interested polytechnic students are encouraged to apply before commencing their undergraduate degree.",
      "eligibility": [
        "Be a Singapore citizen",
