      "english_requirement": null,
      "requirements": [
        "Serve a 4-year bond after graduation in a STEM-related role in Singapore or with a Singapore-headquartered company",
        "Declare Gross Monthly Household Income as part of the application",
        "Complete a four-stage assessment process if shortlisted: an online psychometric and personality assessment, a remote on-demand video interview, a one-day in-person group assessment, and a final 60-minute structured interview",
        "A provisional scholarship offer is conditional on the release of final cumulative GPA, examination results and acceptance into an overseas university"
