        "If shortlisted, attend the one-day in-person group assessment",
        "If selected as a final candidate, attend a 60-minute structured interview"
      ],
      "selection_notes": "Shortlisted applicants complete an online psychometric and personality assessment and a remote, on-demand video interview evaluating general abilities, motivations, interests and values, followed by a one-day in-person group assessment of leadership, agility, teamwork and critical thinking, and finally a 60-minute structured interview for final candidates. A provisional scholarship offer may be extended to a suitable applicant, subject to confirmation on release of the final cumulative GPA, examination results and acceptance into an overseas university. Applicants who will be enlisting for National Service may apply, and preliminary polytechnic diploma results may be submitted.",
      "catalogue_url": null,
