      "description": "Indspire, a national Indigenous registered charity, runs Building Brighter Futures, a bursary and scholarship programme for First Nations, Inuit and Métis students in Canada. One application is used for all Indspire bursaries and scholarships, with only a few named exceptions requiring a separate application. The funding model is deliberately unrestricted: Indspire states that wherever possible funds are awarded to a student to use as they wish, for tuition, childcare, food, cultural support, shelter or travel. Applications for the September 2026 to August 2027 academic year are accepted with deadlines on August 1, November 1 and February 1 at 11:59 p.m. EST, so the programme is accepting applications on 2026-10-04 with the next deadline on 1 November 2026.",
