          "english_requirement": "English Language Proficiency Requirement applies to the English-language LL.M. programmes; the Spanish-language LL.M. en Derechos Humanos y Derecho Humanitario does not require English proficiency",
          "english_requirement_note": "Programme language is stated as English and Spanish for the Human Rights and Humanitarian Law LL.M., Spanish for its Spanish-language version, and English for the International Arbitration and Business Law LL.M.",
