    {
      "name": "Beca de la Escuela Doctoral Franco-Peruana en Ciencias de la Ingeniería y Geociencias (EDFPCIG) - Convocatoria 2026",
      "country": "Peru",
      "region": "Latin America",
      "degree_levels": "PhD",
      "funding_type": "Stipend",
      "program_type": "Binational doctoral scholarship",
      "official_source": "Escuela Doctoral Franco-Peruana en Ciencias de la Ingeniería y Geociencias (EDFPCIG), administrada por la Escuela de Posgrado de la PUCP",
      "official_source_url": "https://posgrado.pucp.edu.pe/becas/beca-escuela-doctoral-franco-peruana-ciencias-ingenieria-y-geociencias/",
      "catalogue_url": "https://posgrado.pucp.edu.pe/becas/",
      "official_updates_url": "https://posgrado.pucp.edu.pe/becas/beca-escuela-doctoral-franco-peruana-ciencias-ingenieria-y-geociencias/",
      "status": "open",
      "is_verified": true,
      "last_verified_date": "2026-10-04",
      "description": "The Escuela Doctoral Franco-Peruana en Ciencias de la Ingeniería y Geociencias (EDFPCIG) is a joint Peruvian-French doctoral training structure funded by its members, the French Embassy in Peru, the Institut de recherche pour le développement (IRD) and the Pontificia Universidad Católica del Perú. For the 2026 call it awards a single doctoral scholarship for a Peruvian candidate to complete a three-year full-time doctorate in geosciences, energy, the environment or related fields, spending year one and year three at PUCP and a one-year research stay in France in year two. The award is a living stipend for accommodation, food and local mobility totalling EUR 39,576 over the 36 months, with non-monetary benefits detailed in the bases. Two supervision modalities are offered: co-tutelage, which leads to a PUCP doctorate and a French Doctorat through a joint agreement, or co-direction, where the student is enrolled only at PUCP.",
      "duration": "Three years (36 months): year 1 doctoral thesis at PUCP, year 2 one-year research stay at a French partner university of the IRD joint unit, year 3 doctoral thesis at PUCP",
      "deadline": "15/10/2026",
      "deadline_date": "2026-10-15",
      "deadline_precision": "exact",
      "application_period": "16/07/2026 to 15/10/2026; results published 04/12/2026",
      "funding_amount": 39576,
      "funding_currency": "EUR",
      "funding_period": "total stipend over 36 months",
      "eligibility_summary": "Peruvian nationals under 40 years of age at the close of applications, holding a master's degree awarded by a Peruvian or foreign higher-education institution properly registered with SUNEDU, in a field covered by the EDFPCIG, and filing the full mandatory documentation.",
      "eligibility": [
        "Nacionalidad peruana",
        "Menor de 40 años al cierre de la postulación",
        "Grado académico de maestro otorgado por una institución de educación superior peruana o extranjera, debidamente registrada ante la SUNEDU, en áreas contempladas en la EDFPCIG",
        "Presentación de la documentación obligatoria de acuerdo con el numeral 3.2 de las bases"
      ],
      "coverage": [
