      "best_fit": "A Peruvian master's graduate under 40 in geosciences, energy, environmental science or a related field who can commit to a full-time three-year doctorate split between Peru and France.",
      "notes": "Only one place is offered in the 2026 call. The doctoral studies are full-time and in person; exceptionally, during the three funded years the scholar may carry out other academic or research activities directly related to the doctorate, with a maximum of teaching one course. The stipend amounts are labelled 'sujeto a modificación' on the official page. Lists of past winners from 2017 to 2025 are published on the same page. Consultas: becas-posgrado@pucp.pe.",
