      "description": "CONICET, Argentina's national research council, opens its 2026 internal postdoctoral call for 800 places, each running thirty-six months from 1 August 2027. It is aimed at candidates who want to complete their academic training and carry out research and who have already defended their doctoral thesis before the scholarship start date. Seventy per cent of the places in each Advisory Commission are allocated to proposals that fall under the council's list of priority themes or under the priority geographic regions and thematic areas published in the call's priority matrix. Applications for this line open on 18 February 2027 and close on 5 March 2027.",
