      "status": "open",
      "is_verified": true,
      "last_verified_date": "2026-10-04",
      "description": "AGCID, Chile's international cooperation agency, runs a South-South cooperation scholarship programme under which professionals from Latin America and the Caribbean study a master's degree at accredited Chilean universities with a high level of excellence. The 2027 call is aimed at degree-holding professionals working in government programmes or ministries and public services, as well as university academic staff, teachers and researchers, and also at professionals working in civil society across the invited countries. Applications go through the national focal point in each candidate's country, and the scholarship takes place in person in Chile. The official Panamanian focal-point page for this call states a closing date of 30 October 2026.",
      "deadline": "30/10/2026",
      "deadline_date": "2026-10-30",
      "deadline_precision": "exact",
      "application_period": "Applications are submitted through each country's national focal point; the official IFARHU page for this call gives a closing date of 30 October 2026. Individual countries set earlier national deadlines, so the focal point in your own country governs.",
      "funding_amount": null,
      "funding_currency": null,
      "funding_period": null,
      "eligibility_summary": "Degree-holding professionals from the invited Latin American and Caribbean countries who work in government programmes or public services, or are academics, teachers or researchers at recognised universities, or work in civil society, and who have been admitted to an eligible Chilean master's programme.",
      "eligibility": [
        "Professionales titulados que se desempeñen en programas y/o funciones gubernamentales, en Ministerios o Servicios Públicos",
        "Personal académico, docentes o investigadores de universidades oficialmente reconocidas por sus respectivos países",
        "Profesionales que se desempeñan en los diversos ámbitos de la sociedad civil de los países convocados",
        "Contar con aceptación definitiva e incondicional de una universidad chilena participante (requisito_differs según el país focal)"
      ],
      "benefits": [
        "Scholarship placement in a master's programme at an accredited Chilean university or higher-education institution",
        "In-person (presencial) study in Chile",
        "Participation in AGCID's South-South cooperation scholarship cohort for the 2027 academic year"
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "Apply within your own country's national focal point deadline, which is earlier than the international cut-off",
        "Submit electronically to the PUNTO FOCAL in your country and send a copy to the Chilean embassy",
        "Hold unconditional acceptance from a participating Chilean institution",
        "Use only a master's programme listed in the call's Annex 1 of accredited programmes"
      ],
      "required_documents": [
