          "description": "AGCID's South-South cooperation scholarship funds professionals from invited Latin American and Caribbean countries to study a master's programme at an accredited Chilean university, in person. The 2027 call targets professionals working in government programmes and public services, academics and researchers at recognised universities, and professionals active in civil society. Applications are handled by each country's national focal point, and the official focal-point publication for this call gives a closing date of 30 October 2026.",
