          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "The master's programme must appear in Anexo 1 of the call. Priority weighting applies to programmes in areas designated strategic by the Government of Chile: astronomy, mining, Antarctic sciences, renewable energies, marine resources, economic development, international trade, international relations, sovereignty and territorial integrity, national security, and the fight against organised crime and terrorism.",
          "application_method": "Online application through the ICETEX postulation platform as focal point; documents uploaded as legible Spanish PDFs; preselection by the Comision Nacional de Becas; final selection by the AGCID Selection Committee",
