      "eligibility_summary": "Women who have completed 12 years of schooling (10+2) with at least 60% in their final Grade X and Grade XII examinations, including at least 60% in English and in Maths individually, and are within 22 years of age. The university is required under its Charter to recruit primarily from South, Southeast and West Asia and the Middle East, and also accepts stateless students and applicants from outside Asia. Financial aid is decided separately by the Financial Aid Committee on assessed family circumstances, not on admission merit.",
      "eligibility": [
        "Completed 10+2, a total of 12 years of education",
