          "description": "The Pacific Agriculture Scholarships and Support (PASS) Program provides scholarships and support to postgraduate students in agriculture, forestry and fisheries at The University of the South Pacific (USP) and Fiji National University (FNU). Since 2005 ACIAR has supported research scholarships at Pacific universities as part of the Australian Government's support to its Pacific neighbours. Scholarships are offered in the Pacific to Pacific Islanders so that scholars can research agricultural problems in context, build relevant professional networks and remain close to family and culture.",
