      "description": "The Government of the Republic of Ghana awards scholarships for full-time, on-campus undergraduate and postgraduate study at public tertiary education institutions in Ghana to qualified nationals of ECOWAS member states other than Ghana for the 2026/2027 academic year. Awards are made in priority fields aligned with regional development priorities, including medicine, nursing, public health, biomedical sciences, engineering, computer science, artificial intelligence, data science, cybersecurity, renewable energy, agribusiness, crop science, animal science, food technology, law and climate studies. Applications run through each applicant's home-country nominating agency, which is subject to a quota of three nominees per ECOWAS member state, so applicants cannot apply directly.",
