          "application_method": "Institution-mediated. The platform FAQ states: 'You can apply for a scholarship through the educational institution where you wish to study by submitting an admission application. The institution will review your application and issue an admission decision accordingly.' Once the institution approves, 'it is processed by both the institution and the Ministry of Education to complete the final admission procedures.' Applicants must first complete their platform profile, because the platform prompts 'Your profile is incomplete. Complete it to apply to academic programs.'",
