      "description": "Türkiye Scholarships is a government-funded, competitive scholarship programme run under the coordination of the Presidency of Turks Abroad and Related Communities (YTB) that places international scholarship holders in Turkish universities. The official 2026 announcement states it is open to citizens of all countries and to applicants seeking associate, bachelor's, master's and doctoral degrees, with applications received in a single annual period from 10 January to 20 February. The programme funds tuition fees, a monthly stipend, health insurance, accommodation, a one-off flight ticket and a Turkish language course, and includes university and department placement. Short-term Research Scholarships and Success Scholarships are separate sub-programmes with their own application periods announced on the same official site.",
