        "Health documentation, subject to a general medical examination on arrival",
        "Completed and signed application form, submitted to the relevant institution in the candidate's country for endorsement"
      ],
      "application_method": [
        "Submit the completed application form through the official Google Form link given in the call",
        "Email scanned original documentation plus Serbian or English certified translations to worldinserbia@prosveta.gov.rs",
        "A copy of the documentation and the health certificate is submitted to the relevant institution in the candidate's country for formal endorsement",
        "The endorsing institution submits the list of endorsed candidates to the Serbian diplomatic-consular mission, which forwards it via the Ministry of Foreign Affairs"
      ],
      "english_requirement": "English at A1 level accepted as an alternative to Serbian; all documentation must be translated into English or Serbian",
      "selection_notes": "Each participating state must nominate endorsed candidates. The Ministry of Foreign Affairs transmits the lists of nominated candidates with all application forms to the Ministry of Education no later than 10 June. A special inter-ministerial commission comprising representatives of the Ministry of Education, the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, the Agency for Qualifications (ENIC/NARIC Centre) and the Student Health Care Institute of Belgrade selects the candidates, and the decision on the final list of endorsed candidates is adopted by the Minister responsible for education no later than 26 June. Scholarships may be terminated for inauthentic or fraudulent documentation, unverified health documentation, failure to pass the Serbian language examination, failure to obtain the required ECTS credits, or voluntary renunciation.",
      "best_fit": "Students from Non-Aligned Movement countries in Africa, Asia and Central and South America who can obtain a government endorsement and are willing to study in Serbian after a preparatory language year.",
