          "description": "The \"World in Serbia\" project is a scholarship programme of the Government of the Republic of Serbia, implemented by the Ministry of Education, that funds study at institutions founded by the Republic of Serbia for candidates from member and observer states of the Non-Aligned Movement. Recipients receive free tuition, accommodation and meals in the student standard system, health insurance and a monthly financial scholarship of RSD 18,000, after a preparatory Serbian-language course.",
