      "description": "The Petroleum Technology Development Fund, a Nigerian federal government agency, sponsors fully funded MSc and PhD places at its partner universities in the United Kingdom, Germany, France and Malaysia for Nigerian candidates in oil and gas related disciplines. The published benefits for the 2026 award are return flight tickets, health insurance, tuition and bench fees where applicable, and allowances for accommodation and living expenses. Application is made through the PTDF Scholarship Management Portal. The 2026 call closed on 27 February 2026 and the Fund has not yet published the 2027 call.",
