      "selection_notes": "There are a limited number of 100% and 50% tuition fee scholarships for outstanding international students. Scholarship results are shared approximately seven weeks after each regional deadline via SISWeb, or no later than two weeks after the Committee has confirmed its decisions. UCD cannot guarantee that all admissions applications will be processed before the scholarship application deadline. Scholarships are not automatically renewed; continuing students are reassessed after the end of the academic year and notified between late September and October.",
      "funding_amount": null,
