      "description": "UCD Global Excellence Scholarships offer a limited number of 100% and 50% tuition fee scholarships to outstanding international students who are classed as non-EU for tuition fee purposes and are applying to undergraduate or graduate taught programmes that appear on UCD's eligible-programmes list. Students must first secure an offer or conditional offer on an eligible course. Application deadlines are regional - 1 February 2026 for North American undergraduates, 28 February 2026 for undergraduate and graduate taught applicants from the Middle East, Africa and Pakistan and graduate taught applicants from South Asia, and 31 March 2026 for all other regions. Results are published via SISWeb about seven weeks after each regional deadline. The award is a tuition fee reduction only, is not automatically renewable, and is reassessed for continuing students between late September and October.",
