      "description": "The MOE Teaching Scholarships/Award (Full-Term) sponsors Singaporean school leavers through a full-time undergraduate degree so that they can enter the Education Service as teachers. Applicants may be offered either an Education Merit Scholarship or Teaching Scholarship administered by the Public Service Commission, or a Teaching Award administered by MOE, and are considered for the full range. Scholars receive undergraduate tuition fees and other approved charges, a maintenance allowance, developmental programmes and approved student exchange, summer programmes and co-curricular activities, against a bond of four to six years depending on where they study.",
