      "eligibility_summary": "Applicants must be Singapore Citizens at the point of offer, well-rounded with good academic and co-curricular activities records, hold a GCE A-Level, International Baccalaureate Diploma, Polytechnic Diploma, NUS High School Diploma or equivalent, demonstrate strong leadership qualities, and possess excellent interpersonal and communication skills. The course of study should be relevant to a teaching subject.",
