      "description": "SgIS is described by MOE as the only multi-industry scholarship in partnership with the Singapore Government, offering Singapore Citizens scholarships at different stages of university education, locally and overseas. Organisations across various industries sponsor scholars, who are groomed through the SgIS Scholars' Development and Engagement Programme and take at least one internship with their sponsoring organisation. The award covers full tuition fees and approved academic charges plus an allowance for living expenses, hostel and overseas exchange, against a bond of four years for most autonomous universities or three years for SIT and LAS.",
