      "description": "The EAN Clinical Fellowship funds a clinical observational placement of six to twelve weeks at an approved EAN host neurological department outside the applicant's country of residence, at EUR 425 per week plus up to EUR 300 of travel costs reimbursed after the fellowship. The programme is designed for neurologists who are still training or have recently qualified, and the total annual budget supports 300 fellowship weeks. Applications for the 2027 round are open from 1 August to 31 October 2026, and results are communicated by the end of December 2026. Active EAN RRFS or Full membership is a condition of applying, and only approved host departments on the published 2027/2028 list may be used.",
