      "eligibility_summary": "Applicants need at least two years of clinical residency training in neurology, an active EAN RRFS or Full membership, institutional affiliation in an EAN Full or Corresponding Institutional Member country or in a low or lower-middle income sub-Saharan African country, fluency in English or the host country's language, and acceptance by an approved EAN host department outside their country of residence.",
      "eligibility": [
        "Minimum two years of clinical (residency) training in neurology at the time of the fellowship",
        "RRFS member working in an EAN Full Institutional Member country, or in a Corresponding Institutional Member country or a low and lower-middle income country in sub-Saharan Africa",
