      "description": "The Research Foundation Flanders awards a three-year junior postdoctoral fellowship to researchers who obtained their doctorate no longer than three years before 1 October of the fellowship start year, to develop an independent research career at a Flemish host institution. The fellowship is paid as a gross monthly salary of EUR 5,616.81 (index 2.1647 on 1 March 2026) for a researcher with four years of seniority, plus a fixed operating allowance or bench fee of EUR 4,000 to EUR 10,000 per year. The current call opened on 17 September 2026 and closes at 5pm on 16 November 2026, with results announced on 13 May 2027.",
