      "application_period": "The 2026 call ran from 6:00 p.m. on May 21, 2026 until 3:00 p.m. on June 22, 2026, Central Mexico Time, with results notified between 6 and 10 July 2026 and studies starting between August and 10 November 2026. AMEXCID publishes an annual convocatoria; no 2027 dates were published as of 2026-10-04.",
      "eligibility_summary": "Open to foreign nationals from more than 170 countries who are resident in, and nominated from, their country of nationality. Applicants must be at least 18, must not hold Mexican nationality or a Mexican family reunification visa, must hold a Temporary Resident Student Card if already residing in Mexico, and must not hold another Mexican government scholarship or an AMEXCID award from the immediately preceding year.",
