    {
      "name": "Bolsas Capacitacao de Curta Duracao no Exterior - Edital Comite Gestor Fiocruz no 02/2026 (CAPES-Global.Edu)",
      "country": "Brazil",
      "region": "Latin America",
      "degree_levels": "Masters; PhD",
      "funding_type": "Fully Funded",
      "program_type": "Research institute short-term training abroad scholarship administered under the CAPES-Global.Edu programme",
      "official_source": "Fundacao Oswaldo Cruz (Fiocruz)",
      "official_source_url": "https://formeditais.campusvirtual.fiocruz.br/editais/cg-fiocruz-022026",
      "catalogue_url": "https://formeditais.campusvirtual.fiocruz.br/editais",
      "official_updates_url": "https://formeditais.campusvirtual.fiocruz.br/editais/cg-fiocruz-022026",
      "status": "open",
      "is_verified": true,
      "last_verified_date": "2026-10-04",
      "duration": null,
      "deadline": "Applications close 23 October 2026 at 16:00 Brasilia time",
      "deadline_date": "2026-10-23",
      "deadline_precision": "exact",
      "application_period": "15/09/2026 to 23/10/2026 (16h, Brasilia time); overseas activities begin September and October 2027",
      "description": "The second of the five editais opened by the Managing Committee of Fiocruz for the 2027 activity year. This call covers the CAPES-Global.Edu modality Capacitacao de curta duracao no Exterior, short-term training abroad. Unlike the sandwich-doctorate call, it is open not only to Fiocruz master's and doctoral students registered on Sucupira but also to Fiocruz teaching staff, researchers and technical staff who hold a formal employment relationship (CLT or statutory) with the institution and are involved in graduate-programme activities. The purpose is individual qualification and institutional strengthening through technical, scientific or pedagogical training courses abroad, expressly excluding language training. Each candidate may register for only one of the five Fiocruz editais, and multiple registrations are automatically voided.",
      "eligibility_summary": "People formally linked to Fiocruz: (a) teaching staff, researchers and technical professionals with a formal (CLT or statutory) employment relationship with Fundacao Oswaldo Cruz who support graduate-programme teaching, research, extension and internationalisation activities, and (b) master's or doctoral students duly registered on the CAPES Sucupira platform as students of a Fiocruz graduate programme. In both cases the candidate's graduate programme must be linked to the CAPES Global network's strategic themes listed in Annex I.",
      "eligibility": [
        "Be formally linked to Fiocruz with a formal employment relationship (CLT or statutory) as teaching staff, researcher or technical professional, and be involved in activities linked to a graduate programme that belongs to the CAPES Global network",
        "OR be a master's or doctoral student duly registered on the CAPES Sucupira platform as a student of a Fiocruz graduate programme that belongs to the CAPES Global network",
        "Be linked to the strategic themes of the Rede CAPES Global para o Desenvolvimento Sustentavel, Ciencia e Saude, per Annex I",
        "Register for only one of the five editais of the Comite Gestor; registering in more than one voids all registrations without exception",
        "Candidates already in process under earlier editais will be considered under only one candidature, the first submission being valid and the rest annulled"
      ],
      "coverage": [
        "Short-term technical, scientific or pedagogical training abroad for Fiocruz staff, researchers and postgraduates",
        "Institutional strengthening of the human resources of the participating graduate programmes"
      ],
      "benefits": [
        "Short-term training placement abroad (treinamentos, cursos tecnicos, cientificos or pedagogicos), expressly excluding language training",
        "Start of overseas activities in September and October 2027"
      ],
      "requirements": [
        "Submit the proposal exclusively through the electronic application form published on the call page",
        "If this is a first access to the Fiocruz site, register beforehand using the link provided on the application page",
        "Choose a single modality among the five Fiocruz editais",
        "Accept the conditions of the Edital, from which no later ignorance may be claimed"
      ],
      "required_documents": [
        "Anexo I - Temas Estrategicos CG Fiocruz",
        "Anexo II - Plano de Atividade Capacitacao",
