      "status": "open",
      "is_verified": true,
      "last_verified_date": "2026-10-04",
      "description": "PUCP's Vice-Rectorate for Research and its School of Postgraduate Studies run a doctoral support programme for candidates seeking to enter a PUCP doctorate with exclusive, full-time dedication to a high-level research project. The Graduate School covers enrolment and academic fees, and the Vice-Rectorate provides a monthly maintenance allowance of four thousand soles for twelve months, renewable, together with PUCP's personal accident insurance, institutional affiliation and a workspace on campus. The grant runs for one calendar year and can be renewed at most twice, and the applicant must hold unconditional admission from the 2027-1 admission process. Applications are open from 10 August to 4 November 2026.",
      "duration": "One (1) calendar year, renewable up to two times; the benefit cannot extend beyond the three-year programme plan (four years for the Mathematics doctorate)",
      "deadline": "04/11/2026",
      "deadline_date": "2026-11-04",
      "deadline_precision": "exact",
      "application_period": "10/08/2026 to 04/11/2026 (registration in the 2027-1 doctoral admission process); eligibility review from 20/11/2026; beneficiary list published 03/12/2026; agreements signed 09/12/2026 to 11/12/2026",
      "funding_amount": 4000,
      "funding_currency": "PEN",
      "funding_period": "per month",
      "eligibility_summary": "Peruvian or foreign citizens holding a master's degree who seek to enter a PUCP doctorate with exclusive full-time dedication, have the backing of a PUCP thesis adviser in that doctoral programme, and hold English at CEFR B2 or above.",
      "eligibility": [
        "Ciudadanos peruanos o extranjeros que hayan obtenido su grado académico de maestro",
        "Aspirar a cursar un doctorado en la PUCP con dedicación exclusiva y a tiempo completo",
        "Contar con el aval de un asesor de la PUCP vinculado al programa doctoral",
        "Dominio del idioma inglés a nivel B2 (MCER) o superior",
        "Obtener la condición de ADMITIDO en el proceso de admisión 2027-1"
      ],
      "coverage": [
        "Derechos académicos (tuition) and matrícula, covered by the Escuela de Posgrado",
        "Asignación mensual de manutención de S/ 4,000 for 12 renewable months, paid by the Vicerrectorado de Investigación",
        "Seguro contra accidentes personales PUCP",
        "Filiación institucional PUCP",
        "Espacio de trabajo en el campus con acceso a recursos institucionales no monetarios (bibliotecas, laboratorios, equipos, uso de aulas)"
      ],
      "benefits": [
        "Full tuition and enrolment fees covered for the doctoral programme",
        "S/ 4,000 per month maintenance allowance for 12 months, renewable",
        "PUCP personal accident insurance",
        "PUCP institutional affiliation",
        "Workspace on campus and non-monetary access to libraries, laboratories, equipment and classrooms",
        "Annual renewal subject to evaluation by the VRI's Dirección de Fomento a la Investigación",
