          "tuition_coverage_note": "\"La Escuela de Posgrado, a través de los programas de Doctorado respectivos, cubrirá los derechos académicos y de matrícula.\" Because the bases also require the grantee to reimburse the amount awarded if the obligations are breached, fully_funded is set to false as the brief requires for awards carrying a repayment obligation.",
