          "funding_label": "Full tuition and enrolment fees plus a S/ 4,000 per month maintenance allowance, PUCP accident insurance, institutional affiliation and a campus workspace, for one calendar year renewable up to twice - but the bases require reimbursement of the amount awarded if the grantee breaches the scholarship's obligations, so fully_funded is false",
          "benefits": [
