          "study_mode": "Presencial, con dedicación exclusiva y a tiempo completo",
          "research_requirement": "Al menos una (1) publicación en la que el becario doctoral sea primer autor, con los requisitos de publicación del Anexo II para cada grupo de evaluación, y al menos una (1) ponencia oral presentada en congreso nacional o internacional especializado y arbitrado. Within the 12 months following the end of the scholarship the grantee must conclude, sustain and pass the doctoral thesis.",
          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "The doctoral research proposals must be aligned with consolidated research lines and should preferably be developed within Research Groups recognised by the VRI, or in PUCP's Centres, Research Institutes or laboratories.",
          "application_method": "Registration in the Beca Doctoral 2027-1 admission process of the School of Postgraduate Studies; the recommendation letters are uploaded by the referees themselves on the Kissflow platform designated by the School",
