          "english_requirement_note": "The official bases require a dominantio del idioma inglés a nivel B2, según el Marco Común Europeo de Referencia (MCER), o superior, evidenced by an English certificate. This is a stated requirement, unlike most Latin American schemes in this shard.",
          "selection_criteria": [
