          "selection_weighting": "Evaluated on a scale of 0 to 20. A minimum score of 18 (percentile 90) is required to proceed to selection. The rubric with the weights and scores is published in Anexo 1 of the bases, which is linked from the page but was not rendered, so the per-criterion weighting is unverified.",
          "duration": "One (1) calendar year, renewable up to a maximum of two opportunities; the benefit cannot extend beyond the three-year programme plan of the doctorate, except where the plan runs to four years as in the Mathematics doctorate",
          "award_holder_conditions": [
            "Desarrollar la investigación doctoral a tiempo completo y con dedicación exclusiva dentro del periodo establecido",
            "Reintegrar a la Universidad el monto otorgado por la beca, en caso de incumplimiento de las obligaciones asociadas a ésta",
            "Presentar anualmente la Ficha de Evaluación del programa doctoral con el detalle de los resultados en los hitos principales",
