          "research_requirement": "Doctorate applicants are supported under the same programme; CHED publishes a separate research allowance for both levels.",
          "subject_or_agency_requirement": "SIKAP Regular and SIKAP-N fund ten priority areas grouped under the acronym CHED TANYAG: Creative Industries; Health and Welfare; Engineering and Advanced Manufacturing; Digital Technology and AI; Tourism; Agriculture, Fisheries, Forestry, Veterinary Services and Food Systems; Natural Sciences; Energy; Actuarial Sciences and Financial Services; Guidance and Counselling. SIKAP-L is a separate legal-education track for Philippine Bar members.",
