          "description": "The Scholarships for Staff and Instructors' Knowledge Advancement Program is a flagship Commission on Higher Education initiative giving teaching and non-teaching personnel of Philippine higher education institutions support to pursue Master's or Doctorate degrees in priority disciplines nationwide. Privileges comprise tuition and other fees at actual cost, a monthly stipend and a research allowance, with both full-time and part-time arrangements supported. Applications run through the sending institution into the SIKAP Management System in numbered batches, and the 2026 Call Cycle is open with Batch 5 closing 5 October 2026.",
