      "description": "The TaiwanICDF Scholarship is the International Cooperation and Development Fund's International Higher Education Scholarship Program, which the Fund describes as offering full scholarships to outstanding students from partner countries to study in Taiwan through its TICA network of partner universities. Applicants apply to one programme at one TICA university per year through the Fund's online application system. The Fund publishes no English-proficiency test requirement of its own, and admission to the university does not by itself confer the award. The 2027 round opens on 1 December 2026 and closes on 15 March 2027.",
