      "application_period": "Annual cycle tied to the Zhejiang University international doctoral intake. The page read on 2026-10-04 still documents the cycle with a 28 February application deadline and late July/early August results; no 2027 intake call had been posted on the International College notice board at the time of checking (the most recent notice there is dated 2026-07-28).",
      "eligibility_summary": "Open to doctoral candidates for medical programmes who apply to the International School of Medicine at Zhejiang University and choose it in the ZJU international student application system, and who are not receiving any other scholarship at the same time. The scholarship is open to both domestic and international doctoral candidates, with Chinese applicants (including Hong Kong, Macao and Taiwan) directed to a separate notice.",
