            "Pick exactly one of the eight thematic areas to target; the award is field-filtered, not general",
            "Check your experience against the level thresholds: 5 years post-graduation for Bachelor's holders, 3 years for Master's or PhD holders",
            "Confirm you are aged 35 or under (45 or under if post-doctoral)",
            "Confirm you can commit 40 hours per week for the full 3 to 6 months and that your employer or institution will release you",
            "Review the Consortium of Excellence member institution list and be ready to approach a potential host",
            "Complete the official COMSTECH application form and submit promptly, because the 10 places are filled first-come, first-served",
            "Assemble evidence of qualifications, experience and English proficiency before submitting"
          ],
