          "deadline_note": "Cohort 4 closed at 17:00 EAT on 10 September 2026, before today's date of 2026-10-04. The official call states Phase II 'commenced in October 2025 and is expected to support at least 280 students across three cohorts', which confirms further cohorts are contracted within this phase, and Phase I launched in 2018 supporting 180 students. However no next-cohort opening or closing date is published as of 2026-10-04, so deadline_date is recorded as null with precision 'recurring' rather than guessing a 2027 date. The published timeline also shows downstream dates of December 2026 for communication of successful students and host universities and for acceptance of offers and signing of scholarship agreements, so Cohort 4 selection is still in progress even though its window has shut.",
