          "citizenship_residency": "Citizenship of one of the eight EAC Partner States: Burundi, Democratic Republic of Congo, Kenya, Rwanda, Somalia, South Sudan, United Republic of Tanzania, or Uganda. The applicant must study in an EAC Partner State other than their country of citizenship, so cross-border mobility into a neighbouring partner state is a mandatory condition.",
          "international_eligibility": "Open to nationals of the 8 EAC Partner States only. Kenya, Rwanda, Uganda and Tanzania all host eligible programmes in this cohort. Female applicants, persons with disabilities and applicants from other disadvantaged backgrounds are strongly encouraged to apply, with a stated aim of at least 50% female participation among beneficiaries.",
          "degree_levels": [
