          "english_requirement": "Applications must be submitted in English. Applicants with academic transcripts, certificates or other supporting documents in languages other than English must submit both the originals and copies translated into English by an accredited language translation provider. An English language proficiency certificate such as IELTS or TOEFL is listed as an optional supporting document (E24) where applicable; no minimum score is published.",
