            "First-degree certificate or statement of results",
            "NYSC certificate or letter of exemption",
            "Second-degree certificate or statement of results (PhD)",
            "PhD research proposal of no more than 6 pages using the portal template",
            "Confirm every file is a legible PDF at the size the portal indicates, since only the passport photograph is exempt from the PDF requirement"
          ],
          "alerts": [
            {
              "trigger": "The 2026/27 window has closed",
              "message": "Applications ran 27 April to 5 June 2026. PTDF runs an annual cycle under the same scheme, so watch https://scholarship.ptdf.gov.ng/news/ for the next call and prepare your documents now, since several of them - a stamped transcript and a certificate of indigeneship - take time to obtain."
            },
            {
              "trigger": "National Identity Number verification comes first",
              "message": "You must have a verified NIN before you can proceed, and NIMC verification charges apply. This is the first practical blocker, not the application form itself."
