          "description": "The Government of Brunei Darussalam Scholarship to Foreign Students Tenable in Brunei Darussalam is a fully funded government scholarship administered by Brunei's Ministry of Foreign Affairs for foreign students taking Diploma, Undergraduate and Postgraduate Master's degrees at five Bruneian higher education institutions. The award covers tuition and enrolment fees, a monthly personal allowance of BND 500, a monthly meals allowance of BND 150, an annual book allowance of BND 600, residential college accommodation, comprehensive insurance, economy-class air travel to and from Brunei and a baggage allowance on completion of the programme. Eligibility is governed by age caps and a published English-language standard, and holders are bound by conditions including no concurrent funding, no paid employment and departure from Brunei on completion.",
