      "application_period": "The official Financial Aid and Scholarships page publishes the financial support application deadline for the 2027–2028 cycle as 'October 2026 – To be announced later' for all categories, including NUET Applicants and international applicants applying under the SAT/ACT category.",
      "description": "Nazarbayev University runs a separate financial support application for applicants who have already received an admission offer, covering Foundation Year Program and undergraduate places for both Kazakh and international students, with several international-specific entry categories. Applicants first accept an admission offer, then submit a financial support application through the Personal Account at admissions.nu.edu.kz, selecting a category: NUET Applicants, SAT/ACT Applicants, Olympiad winners, IB Diploma holders, A-Level/NIS Grade 12 certificate holders or NUFYP Students. The published international deadline for the 2027–2028 cycle is October 2026 with exact dates to be announced, and the official page also states the last SAT and ACT test dates accepted for financial support consideration are 5 December 2026 and 28 November 2026 respectively.",
