      "eligibility_summary": "Applicants must first hold an admission offer from Nazarbayev University and then apply separately for financial support in their Personal Account, choosing one of six published categories. International applicants may qualify under the SAT/ACT category (Digital SAT 1140 or ACT 24 for the Foundation Year, Digital SAT 1240 or ACT 26 for undergraduate programmes, taken in person, valid to 1 August 2027), or as an IB Diploma holder (30 total with 4, 4, 5 in three Higher Level subjects), an A-Level/NIS Grade 12 certificate holder (not less than ABB in three subjects), or a winner of an International or Republican Subject Olympiad. English is required at IELTS 6.0 for undergraduate and IELTS 5.5 for the Foundation Year programme.",
