      "selection_notes": "Application for financial support is considered only if the applicant meets the minimum requirements for the selected category; otherwise the application is not considered. For SAT/ACT and IB/A-Level categories, certificates are considered without superscoring, and NUET test results have no appeal procedure. The university's published regular-admission process assesses eligibility through document upload and shortlisting, with interviews and final notification by email.",
