      "description": "The Brunei Darussalam Government Scholarship for Foreign Students Tenable in Brunei Darussalam, known as BDGS, is the Government of Brunei Darussalam's scholarship scheme for international applicants, administered by the Ministry of Education with applications handled by the Ministry of Foreign Affairs through its Katalyst applicant portal. It covers undergraduate and postgraduate study at institutions in Brunei Darussalam, with tuition paid by the government plus bursaries for accommodation, books, food and personal spending, complementary medical treatment in Brunei government hospitals and travel arranged through Brunei's diplomatic missions. The applicant portal for the 2026/2027 session now displays that applications are closed, and the scheme is announced annually.",
