      "english_requirement": "Where the language of instruction in the qualifying examination was not English, a valid TOEFL result of 550 paper-based, 213 computer-based or 79 internet-based, or IELTS 5.5, or another acceptable proof of English proficiency is required, and a virtual verbal interaction may be requested before the award",
      "selection_notes": "Selection is on merit, after all attached conditions are satisfied and the host institution confirms a seat has been offered. Applications without endorsement from a nominating agency, or from the Ministry of Education where no agency exists, are not considered. Candidates not informed of selection within six months of the application deadline should consider themselves not selected, and the Ministry does not respond to individual queries. The final and binding decision on award rests with the Ministry of Tertiary Education, Science and Research, and the Government reserves the right to offer no scholarship at all following a call.",
      "best_fit": "African Union and African Commonwealth nationals aged 18 to 26 (or under 40 for postgraduate study) who hold or have applied for a place at a Mauritian public institution and can obtain endorsement from their country's nominating agency.",
