      "funding_currency": "MUR",
      "funding_period": "per month",
      "notes": "Tuition and course-related costs are capped at MUR 100,000 per year for SADC beneficiaries and MUR 160,000 per year for non-SADC beneficiaries, on the rate basis published in the 2026 guidelines. Awardees must supplement the monthly allowance to cover living costs, must bear the cost of books and of examination re-sits or repeats, and are expected to arrive with funds for their one-way air ticket and at least USD 1,000 for the first three months.",
