          "deadline_central": null,
          "deadline_central_display": "No central deadline; each nominating agency sets its own deadline, and the host university's admission window is separate, for example 1 October 2025 to 27 February 2026 at the University of Mauritius for the July/September 2026 intake",
          "deadline_central_timezone": "Indian/Mauritius",
          "deadline_note": "The official Call for Application PDF states that applications not processed through the nominating agency will not be considered, and the Guidelines state that the applicant's documents must reach the nominating agency by a deadline determined by that agency and communicated to prospective applicants. No single future calendar date is published, so precision is recorded as recurring.",
          "status": "UPCOMING",
