          "funding_amount": 16500,
          "funding_currency": "MUR",
          "funding_period": "per month",
          "funding_duration": "Monthly for the duration of the award, renewed year on year subject to successful completion of the previous year of study; in the final year the allowance is paid pro rata for six weeks after the last examination",
          "tuition_coverage": true,
          "tuition_coverage_note": "Annual payment of fees and study-related costs up to MUR 100,000 for SADC beneficiaries and MUR 160,000 for non-SADC beneficiaries; amounts above those caps are borne by the awardee.",
