          "citizenship_residency": "Nationals and residents of African Union member states and African Commonwealth countries. Applicants must be resident in their country of nationality and apply through its nominating agency.",
          "international_eligibility": "Open only to African Union member state and African Commonwealth country nationals; not open to students from other continents or to Mauritian citizens, and not open to self-financing African students already studying in Mauritius at the same programme level.",
